      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A chemical compound used in the production of polyurethane, which plays a role in its degradation processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Toluene 2,4-diisocyanate is a chemical used in the synthesis of polyether-PU foam."</data>
