    <node id="&quot;THF&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL BOND"</data>
      <data key="d1">"THF (tetrahydrofuran) is a solvent used for extracting polymers from samples like EPS feedstock and frass."&lt;SEP&gt;"THF (tetrahydrofuran) is a solvent used for extracting residual PS from frass samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"THF (tetrahydrofuran) is an organic solvent used to extract plastic fragments from frass."&lt;SEP&gt;"THF, or tetrahydrofuran, is a solvent used to extract PS from frass samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran (THF) is used for extracting residual polystyrene (PS) content from frass samples, enabling further analysis such as GPC."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran (THF) is a high-purity solvent utilized in polymer analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"THF (tetrahydrofuran) is a solvent used to dissolve PVC and frass samples for analysis in GPC and other processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"THF (tetrahydrofuran) is a solvent used in the extraction of PS from frass during the solid-liquid extraction protocol."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran (THF) is a solvent used in extracting PS residues from frass for GPC analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran (THF) is an organic compound used as a solvent in the extraction process to analyze polymer residues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran (THF) is used for extracting polystyrene (PS) from samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran (THF) is a solvent used in GPC analysis for determining molecular weight properties."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9dfcb3f2424bd027b5888293a0d01d3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fca6acde6809ed3c727d7bffdbfd1ada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d6c72a17160a2bc126220798c799a6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb00229bf45a3bd9b8a17e10a1c93d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7abab621f928edec1e33d1fe2afd4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9af0d95fd5f52d02b9cb33387951963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85c9587b55f24a8ae5ba6b478dbb98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b04ae62930e9961f964284418f1848b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa972c0f1c2838103f61cd8ae101a8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb9111bd088e1990cde867c6d85cf28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54049db5a67a6464f459ccc427765140&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11de08c24a626abb11d37d71e9567e2b</data>
