    <node id="&quot;SOXHLET EXTRACTOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Soxhlet extractor is utilized to extract Styrofoam degradation products from frass using THF."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soxhlet extractor is a device used in the extraction process with THF solvent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Soxhlet extractor is employed to extract materials from fecula using THF at 90°C for 12 hours."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Soxhlet extractor is used for continuous extraction of lipids from lyophilized mealworm bodies."</data>
