    <node id="&quot;AEROMONAS SP.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BACTERIUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aeromonas sp. includes bacteria from the Aeromonas genus with potential roles in polystyrene breakdown."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aeromonas sp. is a bacterial strain isolated from mealworm guts capable of growing on PS, belonging to Family Enterobacteriaceae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aeromonas sp. is a bacterial strain isolated from mealworm guts capable of growing on PS, contributing to polymer degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aeromonas sp. is a bacterial strain isolated from mealworm guts capable of growing on PS."</data>
