    <node id="&quot;MICROBES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Microbes are essential to the biodegradation process within the gut of mealworms, breaking down polystyrene into simpler compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbes encompass a diverse group of microorganisms, including bacteria and fungi, that play key roles in the degradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbes include bacteria and fungi that contribute to the degradation of plastic waste such as PS foam."</data>
