      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Food webs represent the complex interactions among organisms in an ecosystem, disrupted by microplastic pollution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic chemicals infiltrate food webs, potentially harming ecologically important species such as mussels, salt-marsh grasses, and corals."</data>
