    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRASS YIELD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLIC MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Frass yield is an indicator of feedstock digestibility, reflecting the mealworm larvae's ability to process and excrete ingested materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Measure of the waste material produced by mealworm larvae after consuming different diets, indicating digestibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Frass yield is the ratio of frass produced to the polystyrene microplastics consumed, providing insights into digestion and excretion processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Frass yield measures the ratio of frass produced versus PS MPs consumed."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c9af0d95fd5f52d02b9cb33387951963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f54f1dd7372cfa3dc5f348864eed2261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa1a88a43b40afd043514c5f6898ee71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e136b8a35c0d60811b9daf0cbd5729f5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STATISTICAL ANALYSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A method used to analyze data and determine statistical significance between groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Statistical analysis involves evaluating differences among groups using methods like ANOVA and student's t-test to determine significance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Statistical analysis evaluates differences in biodegradation metrics using ANOVA and t-tests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Statistical analysis involves the use of software and methods such as Student's t-test to evaluate differences in larval survival and plastic consumption rates."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-70bab3579af07d0f99a5f948a90fe1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f54f1dd7372cfa3dc5f348864eed2261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-444b8acd02a76616457012e1ac0db23b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb1c38c1c6dc6fea84d8f51b9f706cd2</data>
    </node>
