    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUPEROXIDE ANION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Superoxide anion (\(O_2^-\)) is a type of free radical involved in oxidative stress."&lt;SEP&gt;"The superoxide anion (O2-) is a type of ROS that can cause cellular damage if not neutralized by SOD."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e32e296ef016e2403df45f75eedee219&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e98fb757cb68ae45626058d9c3a15cb4</data>
