    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANTIOXIDANT SYSTEMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL FUNCTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Antioxidant systems in mealworms are damaged as a result of exposure to ultrahigh-MW polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Antioxidant systems include mechanisms that protect organisms from oxidative stress caused by free radicals."</data>
