    <node id="&quot;CELLULOSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">Cellulose is a complex carbohydrate and a natural polymer that forms the primary structural component of plant cell walls. As an organic compound, it plays a crucial role in the structural integrity of green plants. Cellulose serves multiple functions, including acting as a dietary component for certain organisms, such as Tenebrio molitor larvae (commonly known as mealworm larvae), which can biodegrade it through enzymatic processes facilitated by specific enzymes like AXE1 and Eb-G.

The larvae's ability to degrade cellulose is supported by their gut microbiota, which includes microorganisms capable of breaking down this resistant polymer. This degradation process not only provides nutrients for the larvae but also contributes to the broader ecosystem by serving as a nutrient source for microbial communities in environments such as microbial fuel cells. Additionally, cellulose is frequently utilized as a substrate in biodegradation studies, highlighting its importance in understanding enzymatic and microbial interactions.

Resistant waste materials containing cellulose can be processed by the intestinal microbiota of mealworm larvae, further emphasizing the larvae’s role in breaking down complex carbohydrates. Overall, cellulose is a vital structural and nutritional element in nature, with significant implications for both ecological balance and potential industrial applications, particularly in the context of sustainable waste management and bioenergy production.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c68f3ddf96d927254424a036cd8b9acf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfd8d6b8105d9868a4ffadf5779d0df5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-767a2e5a2bde762f9c1b3dbbf7746d09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47c76e5149ac059b1960b533c9e99a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd2f7b94f62fa18de9e02426577d241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0855091c2b50520d68971a532789a9a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e3ac1a351ece6e7f29ea15d8b1c721d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfbd751517e11b1b4052961a01008cbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5dc0ba5d8a1abfb746af0dedb7d575b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-728d6b0b96814c5c3c7b93042e9b9856&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03980ce7209ce3f1b1c62c6ed9961e27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e77298fbeb95f87269261b74c2158d5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3351564dbd6a0ee6a8b97f6687378ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d6035f4b0686837c8c4319bab80d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a603837ad5b989bafd614f5eeb8504c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e540abd667582c77f4d2222836147ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56af93e805daf3987d95ff99ab8e891d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5ea4395a1eb1886507c72cdf33db169&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-158317f8eba5f6198135df044d385935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2741fab96df80d452d2d4cc651730521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79e833cbc3a0a6e2c80e1b69da50317e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d39fc863538a777920c4eafb37bcf8a</data>
