      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Alkaline phosphatase exhibits strong correlations with polystyrene and plays a role in phosphorus transformations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alkaline phosphatase is an enzyme involved in the hydrolysis of phosphate esters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alkaline phosphatase is an enzyme involved in the hydrolysis of phosphate esters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alkaline phosphatase showed strong correlations with polystyrene in gut bacteria, indicating its role in organic phosphorus transformations."</data>
