      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Valine Arylamidase is a proteolytic enzyme with consistent activity levels irrespective of diet or source."&lt;SEP&gt;"Valine Arylamidase is a proteolytic enzyme with consistent activity levels irrespective of diet or source."&lt;SEP&gt;"Valine arylamidase is an enzyme involved in amino acid metabolism, contributing to enzymatic activity patterns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Valine arylamidase is an enzyme that cleaves peptide bonds involving valine residues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Valine arylamidase is an enzyme that cleaves peptide bonds involving valine residues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Valine arylamidase was involved in amino acid metabolism and was studied for its enzymatic activity."</data>
