      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Acid Phosphatase is an enzyme with significant activity levels detected in both the digestive tract and isolated bacterial consortia."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acid Phosphatase is an enzyme with significant activity levels detected in both the digestive tract and isolated bacterial consortia."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acid phosphatase also correlates strongly with polystyrene, contributing to phosphorus metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acid phosphatase demonstrated strong correlations with polystyrene in gut bacteria, suggesting its involvement in phosphorus metabolism."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2aeb4d96b02258056c16688ea13a9e90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1c9087e78bc6ba94c2b63fd88d2ca66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce1f7a057da80b206f8354c70d120c9</data>
