    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VERRUCOMICROBIALES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORDER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Verrucomicrobiales are bacterial orders involved in insect symbiosis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Verrucomicrobiales is a bacterial order involved in the degradation of polymers and nitrogen fixation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Verrucomicrobiales is an order of bacteria involved in symbiotic relationships with insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Verrucomicrobiales is an order of bacteria potentially involved in nitrogen fixation and waste degradation processes."</data>
