      <data key="d0">"SPECIES"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Reticulitermes speratus is a species of termite where Protozoa and Spirochaetes bacteria decompose lignocellulose."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reticulitermes speratus is a termite species harboring nitrogen-fixing bacteria within its gut."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reticulitermes speratus termites harbor Protozoa and Spirochaetes for lignocellulose decomposition."</data>
