    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AGROBACTERIUM SPP.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A genus of bacteria found in the intestinal microbiota of mealworms fed with polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agrobacterium is a genus of diazotrophic bacteria involved in nitrogen fixation, associated with polystyrene-fed larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agrobacterium is a bacterial genus involved in diazotrophic activities characteristic of polystyrene-fed larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d47c76e5149ac059b1960b533c9e99a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d4e1982efefa47339205e972562b51f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0855091c2b50520d68971a532789a9a2</data>
    </node>
