      <data key="d1">"Metagenomics is a field of study that involves analyzing genetic material from environmental samples to understand microbial communities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Metagenomics is the study of genetic material recovered directly from environmental samples, providing insights into microbial communities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The study of genetic material recovered directly from environmental samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"Metagenomics is a technique used to study the genetic material of microbial communities directly from environmental samples."</data>
