    <node id="&quot;NITROGEN FIXATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">**Nitrogen Fixation** is a biological process by which atmospheric nitrogen (N₂) is converted into ammonia (NH₃) or other forms that are usable by living organisms. This process is essential for synthesizing organic compounds and making nitrogen accessible to plants, animals, and other organisms. Nitrogen fixation is primarily carried out by certain microorganisms, including diazotrophic bacteria, which can be found in various environments, such as the soil or within the guts of specific hosts.

In particular, nitrogen fixation has been observed in the gut microbiota of certain organisms, such as Acromyrmex ants and mealworms. In these cases, the bacteria residing in the gut fix atmospheric nitrogen, providing a crucial source of nitrogen to the host, especially under conditions of nutritional deficiency. This symbiotic relationship aids in nutrient acquisition for both the host and the microbiota. Additionally, the process allows for the synthesis of proteins essential for the growth and development of larvae and their associated microbial communities.

Overall, nitrogen fixation plays a vital role in ecosystems by facilitating the availability of nitrogen, an essential element for life, through the conversion of inert atmospheric nitrogen into bioavailable forms like ammonia. This process is fundamental for the nutrient cycles that sustain life on Earth.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-89c37eb3e3a5b6ab731f5dbe280aa054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81610bdb5fdb95d9a333b42668532b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a69982e6abe36c2a0d4a70b78720ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bf827d2b1d02488e17469a22da9e252&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19868f1234aac10de61c710c8352c076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c68f3ddf96d927254424a036cd8b9acf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-550dde13ffd2abcf536dd87f7d4c1b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e37da2fbe64f85c50c36da45006f4c23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aac53ba8b358857c4dcd3b6cd9e8991&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-422e833d3381bd5fd0b5a3d63d9047f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90367ecb21e0f14b2e548acf307a2628&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-813b71242f366f10218c10631cd7dee8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa10245aaff722ac7d69e73bed8afe74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ac1b1db6ffab6f4cfea7a525785a2fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-181e2c8b4d78916fefcf87c119f11d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d6035f4b0686837c8c4319bab80d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa884bb7540491e8ab975e29c46d1f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41b8c7f0b790b0289a7683fde0eca126&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53ab7dd83bf51674598c6a5bdd146b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5050676818c53a0ef6d691d3049e923c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a4712059883b356b4aea23cb7ef1514&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a81144d30653377d6d90e26c4497eb0</data>
    </node>
