    <node id="&quot;LIGNOCELLULOSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A complex organic material found in plant cell walls, serving as a primary food source for termites."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignocellulose is a complex organic material found in plant cell walls, serving as a nutrient source for certain microbes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignocellulose is a complex organic material that forms the structural framework of plant cell walls, often targeted for biodegradation studies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignocellulose-based diets are derived from processed cellulose materials like cardboard. They are less beneficial for mealworm development compared to polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignocellulose is a complex organic material found in plant cell walls, influencing the digestibility of corn straw."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignocellulose is a complex organic material found in plant cell walls, serving as a substrate for degradation processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignocellulose is a complex organic material in CS feedstock, consisting of cellulose, hemicellulose, and lignin."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignocellulose refers to plant dry matter used for high-value chemical production."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignocellulose is a natural compound found in plant cell walls that gut microbes typically digest, potentially adapting them for PET degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-85fe36521680f0d09a603eab04706561&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c84ac252cb9ce906354bda2ad1113aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e8cdca8afb1d7153fba5e3c11b1f669&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411368ddb6a73777c1dd4c683bd389c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c68f3ddf96d927254424a036cd8b9acf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d39fc863538a777920c4eafb37bcf8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-728d6b0b96814c5c3c7b93042e9b9856&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5261cecf34dd62f3f6ee6f6c3e7834&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84297b844ec01d2f58756b669806fd62</data>
