    <node id="&quot;BARLEY BRAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Barley Bran is a dietary component used in feeding Tenebrio molitor larvae, providing essential nutrients."&lt;SEP&gt;"Barley Bran is a nutrient-rich feed provided to the Tenebrio molitor larvae alongside or without Styrofoam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Barley Bran is a nutrient-rich food source for mealworms, providing protein and lipids essential for their growth and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Barley Bran is a specific type of bran used as part of the diet for mealworms in this study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Barley bran is a component of the larval diet, rich in protein, starch, fat content, soluble fibers, insoluble fibers, and ash content."&lt;SEP&gt;"Barley bran is a dietary component containing starch, soluble fiber, insoluble fiber, protein, fat, and ash."&lt;SEP&gt;"Barley bran supplements mealworm diets, affecting growth rates and PS consumption yields."</data>
