      <data key="d1">"Turbidity Measurement assesses the cloudiness of a solution, indicating bacterial growth and activity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Turbidity measurement assesses bacterial growth over time by measuring the optical density of cultures at 600 nm using a spectrophotometer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Turbidity measurement assesses the cloudiness of a solution, indicating microbial growth and activity."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-970b4f5f0c494fbc90aab36156ecc044&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16a478461d1471ca083f90b3f8e7456e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f3d7160b00e54118a03f0273d60bfe0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;16S RRNA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"16S rRNA gene characterization confirms the identity of the microbial isolate Priestia megaterium S1."&lt;SEP&gt;"16S rRNA gene sequence is used for identifying and classifying bacterial species."&lt;SEP&gt;"16S rRNA is a ribosomal RNA gene used for identifying and comparing microbial species."&lt;SEP&gt;"16S rRNA is a gene sequence used for identifying bacterial species and understanding their roles in processes like plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A gene used for identifying bacterial species through sequencing their ribosomal RNA."&lt;SEP&gt;"A gene used for bacterial identification and classification through sequence analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"16S rRNA is a gene used in bacterial identification and classification, sequenced in this study to understand gut microbiota."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 16S rRNA gene is a conserved bacterial gene used for identifying and comparing bacteria based on their DNA sequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"16S rRNA is a gene sequence used in phylogenetic analysis to classify bacteria, identifying PELW2042 as Bacillus sp."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 16S rRNA gene is commonly used in bacterial identification and phylogenetic studies due to its conserved nature across prokaryotes."&lt;SEP&gt;"16S rRNA is a gene marker used for identifying bacterial species in the gut microbiota."&lt;SEP&gt;"16S rRNA is a genetic marker used for bacterial identification and phylogenetic analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"16S rRNA sequences are used for phylogenetic analysis to classify the isolated bacterial strains."&lt;SEP&gt;"A ribosomal RNA gene used for bacterial identification and phylogenetic analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"16S rRNA is a gene used for bacterial identification and classification through sequence analysis."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-361c5d4ba2e879627f4eb7fc4011ee3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25f3365d0b08e5e77183d813ce6a1049&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aface14c9ee7dd5ccd25e7094ed5c1c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bf827d2b1d02488e17469a22da9e252&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e9eb740edf53e540b468122b302cb82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e81a4fde1bdef8287df342fc27193de6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb00229bf45a3bd9b8a17e10a1c93d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31b36e69e51416db099951b925beff9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fd075a78abe1dca64ddea928d3f94b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-970b4f5f0c494fbc90aab36156ecc044&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3196d2d200ebf060e966a565b5eb26de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d39fc863538a777920c4eafb37bcf8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eda80cb027c8107defa00011d491b002&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eba752cb179633f5dd054ee7c9ee2cba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfd05eac1abc28ac416e6a56ccd6a9d6</data>
