      <data key="d1">"Containers used to house mealworms during the experiment, ensuring controlled breeding conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polypropylene containers are food-grade vessels used to house mealworms during experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polypropylene containers are utilized as storage units for mealworms during experiments, maintaining controlled temperature and humidity conditions."</data>
