    <node id="&quot;NUTRIENT BROTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nutrient Broth is a medium used for culturing bacteria, providing essential nutrients for their growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nutrient Broth is a medium used to culture bacterial isolates for degradation analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nutrient broth is a liquid medium used for culturing bacteria isolated from mealworm guts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nutrient broth is a medium used to culture and sustain bacterial growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nutrient broth is a medium used for culturing bacteria to ensure their viability and growth."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2fd075a78abe1dca64ddea928d3f94b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-568e2e90ce0d3bbb4e21079f4252f5de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16a478461d1471ca083f90b3f8e7456e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f3d7160b00e54118a03f0273d60bfe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3646a65acc7cbdc1d20742888b17613a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NUTRIENT AGAR PLATES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CULTURE MEDIUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nutrient agar plates are solid media used for isolating and growing bacterial colonies from mealworm gut samples."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1f3d7160b00e54118a03f0273d60bfe0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROTARY SHAKER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A rotary shaker is a laboratory device used for shaking flasks or tubes to enhance mixing and aeration."&lt;SEP&gt;"A rotary shaker is used to agitate flasks containing bacterial cultures for optimal growth conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A rotary shaker is used to mix nutrient broth with LDPE, HDPE, and PS beads during bacterial enrichment culture experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rotary shaker is a device used to provide agitation during the incubation of microbial cultures."</data>
