    <node id="&quot;CARBOHYDRATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Carbohydrate content decreased in mealworms consuming Styrofoam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Carbohydrates are energy sources that were found to decrease in mealworms consuming Styrofoam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Carbohydrates serve as carbon sources for microbial growth and activity during plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Carbohydrates are nutrients used by organisms for energy. In this study, carbohydrates in mealworms decreased when fed on polystyrene materials, with significant changes observed for raw PS and PSr."&lt;SEP&gt;"Carbohydrates are organic molecules whose levels were assessed in T. molitor bodies according to the feeding type."&lt;SEP&gt;"Carbohydrates are organic molecules serving as energy sources and structural components in biological systems."</data>
