    <node id="&quot;C-O STRETCHING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FUNCTIONAL GROUP"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A chemical property observed in FTIR analysis, representing the stretching vibrations of carbon-oxygen bonds."&lt;SEP&gt;"C-O Stretching represents carbon-oxygen bonds observed in FTIR spectra."&lt;SEP&gt;"C-O stretching peaks observed in FTIR analysis indicate the presence of ether or ester groups in degraded plastics."</data>
