      <data key="d1">"Co-monomers are additional monomers integrated into polymer chains, detectable via FTIR spectroscopy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Co-monomers such as 1-butene, 1-hexene, and 1-octene are introduced during the synthesis of LLDPE to increase short chain branching."</data>
