    <node id="&quot;METABOLOME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Metabolome encompasses all metabolites present in the gut of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Metabolome refers to the complete set of small-molecule metabolites found within an organism or biological system."&lt;SEP&gt;"The metabolome encompasses all metabolites within an organism, reflecting its physiological state and response to environmental stimuli."&lt;SEP&gt;"The metabolome encompasses all metabolites in a biological system, influencing responses to polymers during biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The metabolome encompasses all metabolites in a biological system, reflecting biochemical activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The metabolome represents the complete set of small-molecule metabolites found in an organism, which changes in response to polystyrene biodegradation."</data>
