    <node id="&quot;CIRCULAR ECONOMY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An economic model aimed at eliminating waste and promoting the continual use of resources."&lt;SEP&gt;"Circular economy emphasizes minimizing waste and making the most of resources, relevant in insect production for plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Circular economy promotes sustainable resource use through recycling, reuse, and recovery, applicable to insect production systems."&lt;SEP&gt;"Circular Economy is an economic model aimed at eliminating waste and promoting resource reuse."&lt;SEP&gt;"Circular Economy is an economic system aimed at eliminating waste and promoting the continual use of resources."</data>
