      <data key="d0">"JOURNAL"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A peer-reviewed scientific journal covering research on the chemistry and biology of the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemosphere is a journal dedicated to publishing research on chemical and biological aspects of environmental science."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemosphere is a scientific journal focused on the study of chemical pollutants and their effects on the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemosphere is a scientific journal publishing studies related to environmental chemistry and pollution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemosphere is a journal addressing chemical and biological aspects of environmental issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemosphere is a scientific journal where studies on polystyrene biodegradation by yellow mealworms have been published."&lt;SEP&gt;"A scientific journal publishing research on chemical interactions in the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemosphere explores chemical processes in the environment, including polystyrene degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemosphere is a journal dedicated to publishing research on chemical processes and their environmental impacts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemosphere is a peer-reviewed scientific journal focusing on research about chemicals in the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemosphere is a scientific journal that publishes research on environmental chemistry, including studies on biodegradation and the effects of plastic consumption on organisms."</data>
