      <data key="d1">"Algae are a diverse group of photosynthetic organisms that produce enzymes with various biotechnological applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Algae contribute to the biodegradation of plastics, utilizing their metabolic pathways to break down complex polymers."</data>
