      <data key="d1">"Chitosan is a product derived from T. molitor that can be used for UV-protective packaging."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chitosan, a derivative of chitin, supports the circular economy by providing biodegradable alternatives to conventional materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chitosan is derived from chitin and exhibits properties useful in agriculture, medicine, and environmental applications."</data>
      <data key="d0">"METABOLITE"</data>
    </node>
