      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Issatchenkia is a fungal genus dominant in outer-fed group, accounting for 8.66% of relative abundance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Issatchenkia is a fungal genus dominant in outer-fed group."&lt;SEP&gt;"Issatchenkia is a genus of fungi involved in both polyethylene and polystyrene degradation in the gut of superworms."</data>
