      <data key="d0">"MICROBE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dysgonomonas is a bacterial genus associated with the PS diet in superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dysgonomonas is a genus of bacteria associated with PS diet in the gut of superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dysgonomonas is a genus of bacteria linked to polystyrene degradation in the gut of superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dysgonomonas is a genus of bacteria linked to PET degradation processes."</data>
