      <data key="d1">"Kluyvera is a bacterial genus associated with the PP diet in mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kluyvera is a genus of bacteria associated with polypropylene degradation in the gut of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kluyvera is a genus predominantly present in larval gut microbiota across all diet groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kluyvera is a genus of bacteria identified in the core gut microbiome of superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kluyvera is a bacterial genus predominant in the gut microbiome of Tenebrio molitor larvae during polypropylene degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kluyvera is a genus of bacteria isolated from mealworms involved in nitrogen fixation."</data>
