    <node id="&quot;GLOBAL PLASTIC PRODUCTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ECONOMIC CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Global plastic production has increased significantly, reaching over 322 million tons in 2015, contributing to environmental pollution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Global plastic production refers to the large-scale manufacturing of plastic materials, leading to environmental concerns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Global plastic production is the continuous increase in manufacturing of plastic products, reaching 368 million tons annually in 2019."&lt;SEP&gt;"Global plastic production refers to the worldwide manufacturing of plastic materials, reaching nearly 370 million metric tons in 2021."</data>
