      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mangrovibacter is a bacterial genus related to the PU diet in superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mangrovibacter is another genus of bacteria found dominant in the gut microbiomes of larvae consuming plastics."</data>
