    <node id="&quot;FRASS SAMPLES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL SAMPLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Frass samples are waste products from larvae, analyzed to confirm plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Frass samples consist of residues excreted by Tenebrio molitor larvae after consuming PS, containing transformed PS components."&lt;SEP&gt;"Waste products from larvae, used to analyze changes in plastic functional groups after ingestion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Samples collected from the feces of larvae used for enrichment cultures."</data>
