      <data key="d1">"A reagent used for RNA extraction from larval gut tissue including bacterial biomass."&lt;SEP&gt;"TRIzol Reagent is used for RNA extraction from mealworms in the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"TRIzol reagent (Invitrogen) facilitates RNA extraction from bacterial samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"TRIzol reagent (Invitrogen) is used for harvesting bacterial colonies and RNA extraction in the experiment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e81a4fde1bdef8287df342fc27193de6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-718900b924b6910a58e8ead81c01c723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e69c793c3b67aed7a68bf864c2c7a309</data>
