      <data key="d0">"DATABASE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"NCBI Nr Database contains protein sequences used for annotating assembled sequences of DEGs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The NCBI Nr database is a collection of proteins used for sequence comparison and annotation."</data>
