    <node id="&quot;KEGG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATABASE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A database used for functional annotation of unigenes and identification of metabolites."&lt;SEP&gt;"KEGG (Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes) is a database used for pathway enrichment analysis to identify pathways significantly enriched in the gut microbiota of T. molitor fed with PET."&lt;SEP&gt;"KEGG (Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes) is a database used for pathway mapping of DEGs."&lt;SEP&gt;"KEGG, or Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes, is a database resource for understanding high-level functions and utilities of biological systems."&lt;SEP&gt;"KEGG is a database that combines genomic information with functional and metabolic pathway data."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-41b8c7f0b790b0289a7683fde0eca126&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-718900b924b6910a58e8ead81c01c723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdbea1d06006b95d57c8b628d9e3f8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e69c793c3b67aed7a68bf864c2c7a309</data>
    </node>
