      <data key="d1">"A universal tool for annotation, visualization, and analysis in functional genomics research."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blast2GO is a universal tool for annotation, visualization, and analysis in functional genomics research."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blast2GO is software used for annotation and pathway mapping of differentially expressed genes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blast2GO is software used for functional annotation and enrichment analysis of genes."</data>
