      <data key="d0">"HEALTH MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mortality rate measures the death frequency of yellow mealworms under different experimental conditions, particularly when fed various plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortality rate measures the percentage of mealworms that die during the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortality rate refers to the proportion of yellow mealworm larvae that die during the biodegradation process."</data>
