    <node id="&quot;GPC ANALYSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"GPC (Gel Permeation Chromatography) is a technique used to analyze changes in molecular weights of polymers during plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPC (Gel Permeation Chromatography) is used to analyze molecular weight and distribution changes in plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPC (gel permeation chromatography) analysis is used to evaluate changes in molecular weight distributions of plastics before and after ingestion by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPC Analysis (Gel Permeation Chromatography) is a method used to measure molecular weight distributions of polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPC analysis evaluates the molecular weight distribution of PS residues, revealing depolymerization patterns during biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPC analysis is used to determine molecular weights and molecular weight distribution of additives in foam."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPC analysis measures molecular weight changes in polymers, providing evidence of depolymerization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography used to analyze the molecular weight distribution of PET polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPC analysis measures molecular weight changes in plastics, revealing the biodegradation process in the frass of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography measures molecular weight changes in plastics, confirming biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPC analysis (gel permeation chromatography) is a method used to determine the extent of polymer depolymerization in mask layers."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPC Analysis is a technique used to measure molecular weight distributions of PS residues, indicating depolymerization and degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPC analysis (gel permeation chromatography) evaluates molecular weight changes in polystyrene after passing through the larval guts."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPC analysis is a method used to characterize the molecular weight distribution of polymers, indicating PS depolymerization and degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPC analysis measures molecular weight changes in polymers during biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel Permeation Chromatography analysis used to study the molecular weight distribution of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPC analysis is a technique used to measure molecular weight distributions of polymers, confirming biodegradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-630e33352368a0c7f34d56ad45a38e56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d5a9fbe4803ded646c6a5e4d23ca93a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0638e0fe93dc27e678672a164e6088c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb5478046e8b80ff49694ccdb8f92fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-582f48080aab075de76c9c590558639f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e24cc3865ed97850c3f25795ff514e8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e05bc34fccfca5e177064daf8346866&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-490fdb90ad8a65d35f3c2cd42a8c4c8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4df787efdb36123e3f2a76b5402278ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d33654bada6ddaf4917586dd5fd41e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b7c2ef16f6809388c0c1a87c26bd5c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89344d5b5d9debdca45ab8c7c963a585&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e97dc712df43805c553423ceb65cd6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0881f766e34a5d97ee711cd2edd793f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5540fc6fe4d3ef0fd986ec36a589c77f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77a9d70651c9f13362e4c1e3ce10eab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f545e57b1a2b3da8601b4d23e1260c94</data>
    </node>
