      <data key="d0">"HEALTH MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Measured as the death rate of Tenebrio molitor larvae, with white EPS causing higher mortality than grey EPS."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortality measures the rate of death among mealworms exposed to microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortality refers to the death rate of mealworms affected by MPS ingestion at older larval stages."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate of death in a population, measured as a percentage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortality refers to the death rate of Tenebrio molitor larvae during the EPS processing experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortality refers to the death rate of yellow mealworms when exposed to different types of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortality refers to the death rate of larvae influenced by their diet and exposure to plastics with varying degradability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortality measures the death rate of larvae over time, calculated based on weights of dead individuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortality measures the death rate of mealworms under various dietary conditions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-02a57c5d6ee92292f1b1bd3dbe76e612&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ee541583aebc7a78ac49285860e4da0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5b6629e8c030ab3162553d83aa6eca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-110013d54a5fd492446b1fe049a60fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-640f0655e17fab473cca3b460c2795de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cc0afd02f25b584d6e3a755fc7272b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7df3b1ec42b9ac5c08513c3b568a399&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f545e57b1a2b3da8601b4d23e1260c94</data>
