      <data key="d2">chunk-47ee82f655853704e6653d8146973278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HOLOGENOME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENETIC CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The combined genetic material of an organism and its associated microbiota, as seen in Galleria mellonella."&lt;SEP&gt;"The hologenome concept includes the genetic material of an organism and its associated microbiota, influencing metabolic processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The hologenome encompasses the genetic material of both the host organism and its associated microbial communities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The hologenome encompasses the genetic material of both the host organism and its associated microbiota."&lt;SEP&gt;"The hologenome refers to the collective genome of an organism and its associated microbiota, influencing overall biological functions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-47ee82f655853704e6653d8146973278&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f15cc70e99a3287ced1a6cbb6c8d76a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-032b3b0fe0366e6e76e86abf8c48d200&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-827853316f7304c444884dc82f757802&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b50c5a85182344022614ffe10dc9382</data>
