      <data key="d0">"DATABASE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The NCBI database contains genetic sequences used for comparing and identifying bacterial strains."&lt;SEP&gt;"The NCBI database is a repository where the novel alkB gene sequence was published under accession number OP959069."&lt;SEP&gt;"The NCBI database is used for publishing novel nucleotide sequences and conducting BLASTp analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"The NCBI database houses genetic sequences and information used for comparing and identifying bacterial isolates through BLAST."&lt;SEP&gt;"The NCBI database is used for comparing and identifying bacterial sequences obtained from genomic DNA extraction."</data>
