      <data key="d1">"The 16S ribosomal RNA gene is used for bacterial identification and classification, revealing the genera of bacteria isolated from T. molitor guts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 16S ribosomal RNA gene was targeted for amplification using designed primers to confirm the identity of the isolated bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 16S ribosomal RNA region is amplified to confirm bacterial species identity."</data>
