      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Alkane-1-Monooxygenase is the enzyme encoded by the alkB gene, responsible for the oxidation of alkanes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alkane-1-monooxygenase is an enzyme potentially responsible for the degradation of polystyrene by Klebsiella oxytoca."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alkane-1-monooxygenase may be one of the main enzymes responsible for polystyrene degradation by Klebsiella oxytoca."</data>
