      <data key="d1">"Basic Local Alignment Search Tool (BLASTp) is a bioinformatics program used to compare amino acid sequences against databases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Basic Local Alignment Search Tool for proteins (BLASTp) is used to compare protein sequences against a database to find similar sequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Basic Local Alignment Search Tool for proteins, used to compare amino acid sequences against databases."</data>
