      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fetal bovine serum is a nutrient supplement added to the cell culture medium at 5% concentration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fetal bovine serum is a supplement used in cell culture media to support cell growth."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2934b88523093a8bba74cc29a0c775e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5911f995d46a77458be83382b8c67f9b</data>
