    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TMLP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"TMlp is the powder prepared from Tenebrio molitor larvae used in the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"TMlp refers to Tenebrio molitor larva powder, a nutritional component tested for its safety and efficacy in rat diets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tenebrio molitor larvae powder (TMlp) is a product derived from mealworm larvae used as a dietary supplement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tenebrio molitor larvae powder, a dietary supplement or experimental material used in biological studies."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9e88a3caade44f7fbc493dfc1c3ca8f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e755eeac14110dcfdcfc32e51f30b89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5911f995d46a77458be83382b8c67f9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bae14ee5ac26fe661b539bccaa825fb4</data>
    </node>
