    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CRUDE PROTEIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRITIONAL COMPONENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A macronutrient present in high concentration in TMlp, contributing significantly to its nutritional value."&lt;SEP&gt;"Protein content in Tenebrio molitor L., exceeding 50%, making it a valuable nutritional source."&lt;SEP&gt;"The primary nutrient measured in the insect biomass, determined using a conversion factor of 6.25 from nitrogen content."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crude protein refers to the total amount of nitrogen-containing compounds in the yellow mealworm larvae, indicating their nutritional value."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crude protein is a key nutrient content measured in the larvae, reflecting their nutritional status and biomass composition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crude protein measures the nitrogen content in the biomass, indicative of protein levels in the larvae's diet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crude protein refers to the protein content in the biomass composition of larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crude protein is a nutrient calculated by determining the total nitrogen content and multiplying it by a conversion factor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crude protein represents the calculated protein content derived from nitrogen measurements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crude protein represents the nitrogenous substances measured in larvae and excrement, varying based on the type of feed."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c095cc3175666d5093fe411f9a39cb66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2359b10600f30376fe077f5e942cc999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d4ea946a931acf7e5a8292c30ea4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ee541583aebc7a78ac49285860e4da0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb1c38c1c6dc6fea84d8f51b9f706cd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbf28f07f3e46b29e447aae784667c29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf697c73d05470fb4a143aa0e4700787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a170da66288c73388872b8a43fa51e33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81a3bc3c202af119c80775d5bf23d8b2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CRUDE FAT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LIPID"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A lipid fraction in TMlp, providing energy and essential fatty acids."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crude fat is a key nutrient content measured in the larvae, reflecting their energy reserves."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crude fat refers to the total lipid content in the biomass, assessed during nutritional evaluation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crude fat represents the lipid content in the biomass composition of larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cf697c73d05470fb4a143aa0e4700787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ee541583aebc7a78ac49285860e4da0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb1c38c1c6dc6fea84d8f51b9f706cd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d4ea946a931acf7e5a8292c30ea4c7</data>
