      <data key="d1">"A staining process used to evaluate long-term toxicity by examining tissues under a microscope for histopathological abnormalities."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-81a3bc3c202af119c80775d5bf23d8b2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KIDNEYS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGAN"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The kidneys are organs examined for potential toxicity effects from W/ eps TMlp administration using H\&amp;E staining."&lt;SEP&gt;"The kidneys were examined through H&amp;E staining and showed no histopathological abnormalities."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4c1e1694d44433fcf53dc8120c479ca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81a3bc3c202af119c80775d5bf23d8b2</data>
    </node>
