      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A model used to analyze growth, development, and survival effects of polystyrene diets on Tenebrio Molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dynamic Energy Budget model analyzes the effects of polystyrene diet on Tenebrio molitor larval growth, development, and survival."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dynamic Energy Budget model is a mathematical framework used to analyze energy flow within organisms, particularly useful in studying larval growth and survival."&lt;SEP&gt;"The DEB model is a mathematical framework describing energy and mass fluxes in organisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The DEB model is a mathematical framework used to describe the energy flow within organisms, aiding in understanding their growth, survival, and reproduction."</data>
