      <data key="d1">"Byproducts from vegetables and fruits like potato, cabbage, carrots, or apple that can serve as a diet for mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vegetable and fruit wastes such as potato peels are alternative feeds for breeding mealworms."</data>
