    <node id="&quot;POLYLACTIDE (PLA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A biodegradable plastic polymer also degraded by certain insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"PLA is a biodegradable polymer derived from renewable resources like corn starch or sugarcane."&lt;SEP&gt;"PLA is another type of bioplastic made from renewable resources, also known for its biodegradability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polylactide is a biodegradable thermoplastic aliphatic polyester derived from renewable resources like corn starch or sugarcane."</data>
