      <data key="d1">"Aquatic organisms that inhabit marine ecosystems and are affected by plastic pollution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sea creatures negatively impacted by plastic pollution."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b77d05458a2050e3057c427cf81e24ef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIOLOGICAL DIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ECOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The variety of life forms in an ecosystem, threatened by plastic pollution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The variety of life forms within a given ecosystem, threatened by environmental degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b77d05458a2050e3057c427cf81e24ef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HUMAN HEALTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"HEALTH MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Human Health is a critical factor in determining the safety of consuming insects fed on Styrofoam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Potential risks posed by plastic pollution to human well-being."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health is at risk from ingesting chemicals leached from plastics or microplastic debris."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health is directly influenced by exposure to microplastics through contaminated food chains and environments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health encompasses the physical, mental, and social well-being of individuals, potentially affected by pollutants like microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health pertains to the overall well-being of individuals, potentially affected by exposure to microplastics in contaminated environments."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a097963ab8ec0ad6b1d51685fc359027&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77d05458a2050e3057c427cf81e24ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa27760a0a889fe7b58360dbb150cdf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ffec9fc63ae323ee0c22c612bb89755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b0664a95aeeb896dcab096b098c3b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c7bcc9530f9dc72038f774f6f084ab6</data>
    </node>
