    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NUTRITIONAL VALUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRITIONAL COMPONENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nutritional value affects mealworm metabolism, with plastics providing less nutrition than natural fibers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nutritional value refers to the nutrient content of food or organisms, which can be affected by their diet."&lt;SEP&gt;"The assessment of nutrients and energy content in food items."&lt;SEP&gt;"The assessment of dietary benefits in edible insects consuming polystyrene."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-276c82b9935756a3e668c788458ff922&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b74f16813537103549cdcb6770abaea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb16cd27b6682965375050748ee77862&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77d05458a2050e3057c427cf81e24ef</data>
    </node>
