      <data key="d0">"ANTIBIOTIC"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Streptomycin is an antibiotic used in the maintenance of cell cultures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Streptomycin is part of the antibiotic cocktail administered to superworms to eliminate active gut bacteria."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b8b7b5a840af17cee78d71347e532d51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db672d5836dfe372ee7c47ee4dd6fbd3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEUTRAL RED ASSAY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Neutral red assay evaluates lysosomal activity and cellular uptake of neutral red dye."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-db672d5836dfe372ee7c47ee4dd6fbd3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KJELDAHL METHOD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Kjeldahl method is a chemical process used to determine protein content in samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Kjeldahl method is employed to determine the protein content in yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Kjeldahl method is a process used for determining total protein content through mineralization, distillation, and titration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Kjeldahl method is a standard procedure used to determine the nitrogen content in biological samples."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d01d291012bd548fc067e250ec39fba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb3edd44829125161ad624ea793ae71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db672d5836dfe372ee7c47ee4dd6fbd3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOXHLET EXTRACTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Soxhlet extraction determines fat content by extracting lipids from samples with solvents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soxhlet extraction is a method used for extracting lipids or other soluble components from solid materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soxhlet extraction is a process used to extract crude fat from homogenized whole insects using petroleum ether."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soxhlet extraction is a technique used for fat determination in this study."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-246606838d14d58d03d733b6250a0460&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5279ebea7d4d5e22eebe3106de3ba1c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db672d5836dfe372ee7c47ee4dd6fbd3</data>
    </node>
