      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL FUNCTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Feeding Behavior describes how insects consume Styrofoam, impacting their health and suitability for human consumption."&lt;SEP&gt;"Feeding behavior describes how mealworms interact with different plastic forms."</data>
