      <data key="d2">chunk-6264a99190316d0aeed63b5d6485999e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NITROGEN-PROTEIN CONVERSION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The nitrogen-protein conversion process evaluates the protein content in edible insects like Tenebrio molitor, Alphitobius diaperinus, and Hermetia illucens."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-97444337eddb4e9e3d88bde93ce02aef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ORAL DOSE TOXICITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"HEALTH MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Oral dose toxicity assesses the adverse effects caused by ingestion of substances, such as freeze-dried powder of Tenebrio molitor larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-97444337eddb4e9e3d88bde93ce02aef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HAZARDOUS ADDITIVES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TOXIN"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hazardous additives found in Styrofoam debris pose risks to marine organisms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-97444337eddb4e9e3d88bde93ce02aef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARINE ORGANISMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Marine organisms are affected by hazardous additives from Styrofoam debris, indicating environmental concerns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Marine organisms are living beings in marine ecosystems that can ingest or be affected by microplastics, impacting food security and safety."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-97444337eddb4e9e3d88bde93ce02aef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ffec9fc63ae323ee0c22c612bb89755</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NITROGEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A key element measured to estimate protein content in the insect biomass."&lt;SEP&gt;"A nutrient measured in frass, showing differences between various diets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen is an essential element measured in insect biomass to estimate protein content."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen is an essential nutrient component studied in the context of protein conversion in edible insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen is an essential nutrient lacking in PS, crucial for the long-term survival and growth of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen is an essential element found in worm frass, making it a suitable substitute for traditional fertilizers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen is an essential nutrient found in worm frass, contributing to plant growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen is an essential nutrient provided through nitrogen fixation by bacteria in the larvae fed PET."&lt;SEP&gt;"An essential element required for protein and nucleic acid synthesis, crucial for insect growth and metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen is a critical component of yeast, making it a superior dietary source for mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen content decreases in frass from Tenebrio molitor fed a polystyrene diet compared to control diets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen content in the insects' biomass and frass varies depending on the diet provided."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen levels decrease in the frass due to higher retention caused by oxidative stress conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen is an element essential for protein synthesis and overall growth of waxworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen is crucial for protein synthesis and overall growth in lesser waxworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"An element present in polyester plastics, potentially influencing the enrichment of fungal colonies in the gut."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen is an essential nutrient required for the long-term survival and development of larvae, which is absent in PP."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen is a critical nutrient whose fixation is studied in this experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen is an essential element used in biological processes such as nitrogen fixation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c83f95e0134b38f78f2624da01ab0f79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97444337eddb4e9e3d88bde93ce02aef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c095cc3175666d5093fe411f9a39cb66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b12451ba2a22e6f74c543f982a0a7b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0d2f43eebe2309fba46c5335d76df56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab6b219720db5a6e3384c884c280984c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e34d58a20a707b35e8fcd5658ba2924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3092744be0c66dad5833977dedd913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5922f60fcd06ac6ffa27018026871346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32e10966ec80ea585746639b6be7e04e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2122660fcfebecf752000198a16f222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e37da2fbe64f85c50c36da45006f4c23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6338d56b535220f260826703b0f7229&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b30daa90b5c91314e1d65e87f191166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d290a6a81802d3048c35d2a2fb1252c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c818a01113d8c07554629cc5edfd28f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32f340b7166025be3c56178a94ae480d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b25215becbc007a60f24b86a2d6aaf26</data>
    </node>
