    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PLASTIC POLLUTION&quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-6aab9d327fcd7d10b5d4fbb22c03292a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a889b716cac361e6e04405777075076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07aae06c64778453da4bda48f5347de5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d3b3c7bbc61318a9728caff13ac5b04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77d05458a2050e3057c427cf81e24ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ffec9fc63ae323ee0c22c612bb89755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76cb64e0aa4e4039b70799a0df8943d</data>
      <data key="d1">"Marine wildlife suffers from the ingestion of and entanglement in plastic debris, highlighting the need for effective waste management solutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic pollution is an environmental issue caused by the accumulation of plastic waste, leading to ecological and health concerns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic pollution refers to the environmental issue caused by non-biodegradable plastics, which mealworms may help address."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic pollution is a global threat affecting human and environmental health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic pollution encompasses the negative effects of plastic waste on natural habitats and wildlife."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic Pollution describes the accumulation of plastic waste in the environment, affecting wildlife, habitats, and human health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic Pollution refers to environmental contamination caused by plastic waste."</data>
      <data key="d0">"ECOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
    </node>
