      <data key="d1">"Achroia grisella efficiently biodegrades polyethylene (HDPE), offering an ecological solution for plastic waste management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyethylene (HDPE) is a type of plastic commonly used for packaging, which can be degraded by the lesser waxmoth Achroia grisella."</data>
