    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PLASTIC CONSUMPTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLIC MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Plastic Consumption measures the amount of plastic consumed by larvae over a specific period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic consumption refers to the ingestion and processing of plastic materials by organisms like mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic consumption is a metabolic measure quantifying the amount of plastic consumed by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic consumption quantifies the amount of plastic ingested by mealworms over time."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4df787efdb36123e3f2a76b5402278ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ada834fc8d4bea41c0ce1770d6f57e4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02a57c5d6ee92292f1b1bd3dbe76e612&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e97dc712df43805c553423ceb65cd6b</data>
