      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL CHARACTERISTIC"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Particle size impacts the regulation of micro-polystyrene biodegradation and development in Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Particle size is a physical characteristic that affects the ability of mealworms to consume microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Particle size influences the bioaccumulation and environmental impact of microplastics."</data>
