    <node id="&quot;METAMORPHOSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Metamorphosis describes the developmental stages undergone by mealworms, culminating in adult beetles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Metamorphosis describes the transformation of larvae into pupae and then adults in the life cycle of Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Metamorphosis is the biological transformation of mealworms from larvae to pupae during their life cycle."&lt;SEP&gt;"The biological process of transformation from larva to pupa and adult, influenced by the type of diet."&lt;SEP&gt;"The transformation process from larva to adult form in insects."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ee46611b24ea3848df979ded841f06b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ead6f17ad517015b638608c5bfe6852&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02a57c5d6ee92292f1b1bd3dbe76e612&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02f21478b87845df31740b3dab37d197&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f65bf081bdd3c6718fa0310993bfc0d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RIGID PP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
