      <data key="d0">"ECOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Environmental Contamination describes the accumulation of polystyrene and other plastics as pollutants in natural ecosystems."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental Contamination refers to the presence of harmful substances in the environment, affecting ecological and human health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental contamination refers to the pollution caused by microplastics entering ecosystems."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-457d054c08a16428ed81526fc2ddce41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02a57c5d6ee92292f1b1bd3dbe76e612&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-915331bc1ae85fe139629eaebc4042cd</data>
    </node>
