    <node id="&quot;GLOBAL RIGID PLASTIC PACKAGING MARKET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The global rigid plastic packaging market represents the economic value and growth potential of rigid plastics."</data>
