      <data key="d0">"LIFE STAGE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"OLS is the late larval stage where mealworms exhibit greater resilience to microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"The OLS refers to three-month-old mealworms weighing approximately -80 mg ind⁻¹ used in the experiment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1283355f048671359adcde7d3137af9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84558838faaf585c61e883356c52c0e0</data>
    </node>
