    <node id="&quot;GENE ONTOLOGY (GO)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gene Ontology is a major bioinformatics initiative to standardize the representation of gene and gene product attributes across all species."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gene Ontology is a major bioinformatics initiative to unify the representation of gene and gene product attributes across all species."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gene ontology provides a framework for understanding gene functions and their roles in biological processes such as PET depolymerization."</data>
