    <node id="&quot;FUNGAL ENZYMES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fungal enzymes are catalytic tools used for the degradation of polyethylene terephthalate (PET)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fungal enzymes are proteins produced by fungi that catalyze specific biochemical reactions, such as the breakdown of plastics."</data>
