      <data key="d1">"An academic institution involved in organizing and supervising worldwide surveys and conducting experiments on PS degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University and its collaborators conduct research on the biodegradation of plastics using T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an academic institution that provided financial support for the research through the Woods Institute for Environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University conducted previous research on PE-2 biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an institution involved in research and development of environmental science and technology solutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University supported research on plastic degradation through mealworms via the Woods Institute for Environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University researchers, including Craig S. Criddle and Anja M. G. Brandon, provided valuable input to the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is where Professor Wei-Min Wu provides suggestions for the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an institution involved in research related to environmental engineering and biodegradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c2cfbb4289b0cc4c8b69884f6d57c447&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fb491e686c96e54f8ea43a9f1ba97eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b7c2ef16f6809388c0c1a87c26bd5c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa972c0f1c2838103f61cd8ae101a8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b759b81206d0e33e320f2d61e540ae47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5338aa2127367c868a3e7331e1f66225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70eb294c60e73338ed59a2eddf057c1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39598f698094d1663ca3438bc143bc90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f6621e8191c2fc4d28a63e80e5d467e</data>
