      <data key="d1">"Vegetables are part of the larval diet, providing water and other nutrients."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vegetables included in co-diets enhance larval growth and plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vegetables provide additional nutrients to mealworms, supporting their growth and health."</data>
