      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gut microflora refers to the community of microorganisms residing in the digestive tract of organisms like Plesiophthalus davidsi larvae, which contribute to the biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut microflora refers to the microbial community present in the gut, which plays a role in plastic degradation."</data>
