    <node id="&quot;ILLUMINA MISEQ PLATFORM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A high-throughput sequencing platform used for analyzing microbial communities."&lt;SEP&gt;"A high-throughput sequencing platform used for paired-end sequencing of microbial amplicons."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina MiSeq platform is a sequencing technology used to sequence the V3-V4 region of the 16S rRNA gene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina MiSeq platform is recommended for sequencing 16S rRNA gene amplicons."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Illumina MiSeq platform is a high-throughput sequencing technology used for paired-end sequencing of purified amplicons."&lt;SEP&gt;"A sequencing platform used for paired-end sequencing of amplified DNA fragments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina MiSeq Platform is used for sequencing the V3-V4 region of the 16S rRNA gene."</data>
