      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bacterial cultures are used in tests to study biodegradation and microbial activity on polymer surfaces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bacterial cultures represent the replication of gut processes and conditions for technological approaches to plastic waste management."</data>
