    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOY PROTEIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROTEIN"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Soy Protein is a nutrient supplement fed to mealworms, which enhances PS degradation rates and increases weight gain."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soy Protein is another dietary supplement tested alongside PS, impacting mealworm survival rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soy protein is a dietary supplement used to enhance the degradation of PS by providing additional nutrition to mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soy protein is a nutritious feed supplement enhancing the specific consumption rate of plastics by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soy protein is another co-diet component that significantly increases PS consumption by larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soy protein serves as a co-diet supplement enhancing larval growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soy protein is another dietary supplement tested alongside wheat bran to support mealworm growth and PS degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soy protein is a nutrient source that significantly improves larval PS consumption rates."</data>
