      <data key="d1">"Differential Scanning Calorimetry (DSC) measures melting point and crystallinity changes in HDPE during biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Differential scanning calorimetry (DSC) studies crystallization and melting processes of materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Differential scanning calorimetry measures thermal transitions to confirm the glass transition temperature of PS."</data>
