      <data key="d1">"SDS (sodium dodecyl sulfate) is a surfactant used for cleaning plastic samples before WCA measurement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sodium dodecyl sulfate, a detergent used to wash PE particles and remove contaminants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sodium dodecyl sulfate, a detergent used to wash samples before FTIR analysis."</data>
