    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LB MEDIUM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A general-purpose bacterial growth medium used as a comparison to nitrogen-free enrichment medium."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB Medium, containing NaCl, tryptone, and yeast extract, is used for bacterial cultivation and enrichment."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB medium (Luria-Bertaini medium) is used for isolating single bacterial colonies, containing bacteriological tryptone, yeast extract, NaCl, and agar."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB medium is a nutrient-rich culture medium used for growing bacteria like PELW2042 under optimal conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB medium is a nutrient-rich medium used for bacterial growth and assessment of inhibition halos."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB medium is a nutrient-rich broth commonly used for culturing bacteria in laboratory settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"A nutrient-rich medium prepared with bacteriological tryptone, yeast extract, NaCl, and agar for microbial cultivation."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB Medium is a nutrient medium used for bacterial growth, containing sodium chloride."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB Medium serves as a standard nutrient medium for culturing microorganisms in various experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB medium is a nutrient-rich broth used for culturing bacteria, providing essential nutrients for bacterial growth."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-361c5d4ba2e879627f4eb7fc4011ee3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfa1d3c9710e10c5eb533d8d791c93e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fca6acde6809ed3c727d7bffdbfd1ada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77817419b966e501f1106866cbea7350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70735757eafccc0f762f21f5d3ac8556&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d80979bb7e58b10bb558705b5d96fa99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10f59d5d10f08e8107f36bff5a4c93ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70bab3579af07d0f99a5f948a90fe1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f28f1c36076d1f249dbc4cd67b16f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfd05eac1abc28ac416e6a56ccd6a9d6</data>
    </node>
