    <node id="&quot;ERLENMEYER FLASK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Erlenmeyer flask is a laboratory equipment used for the enrichment culture of PS-degrading microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Erlenmeyer flask is used to hold the culture mixture of LCFBM and PS for incubation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Erlenmeyer flasks (250 mL) are used for preparing and autoclaving LCFBM medium."&lt;SEP&gt;"Laboratory equipment used to hold and mix solutions during enrichment cultivation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Erlenmeyer flasks are used for preparing and incubating cultures and solutions."</data>
