    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PARAFILM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Parafilm is a sealing product used to preserve plates containing bacterial cultures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parafilm is used to seal LB plates if they are not used immediately, preserving them for future use."</data>
