    <node id="&quot;INTERNATIONAL BIODETERIORATION AND BIODEGRADATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"International Biodeterioration and Biodegradation is a scientific journal focusing on the biodeterioration and biodegradation processes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d97be338c51b4c4354e2d0f8de9c9dc8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLYETHYLENE MULCHING FILMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Polyethylene mulching films are agricultural products made from polyethylene, used for soil protection and moisture retention."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyethylene mulching films are degraded by co-cultures of Acinetobacter sp. strain NyX450 and Bacillus sp. strain NyZ451 isolated from Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyethylene mulching films are agricultural products used to enhance crop growth but pose environmental challenges due to their persistence."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e4b3c26a06ad850bb97d0ca2d9217be1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d97be338c51b4c4354e2d0f8de9c9dc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9528beb2e85a7fb89449a9233eb979bf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIOMINERALIZATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biomineralization refers to the process where microorganisms convert organic materials into mineral components."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d97be338c51b4c4354e2d0f8de9c9dc8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHEMICAL AND PHYSICAL CHARACTERIZATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A process involving the analysis of chemical and physical properties of substances such as polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemical and physical characterization involves analyzing the properties of materials to understand changes during processes like biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemical and physical characterization involves analyzing the properties of materials, such as polystyrene, during biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemical and physical characterization involves analyzing the structural and compositional properties of materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemical and physical characterization involves analyzing the structural and compositional changes in materials like polystyrene during biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemical and physical characterization involves analyzing the properties of substances, such as polystyrene, during biodegradation processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Methods used to analyze the changes in polystyrene during its biodegradation by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemical and physical characterization involves analyzing the structural and compositional changes in materials during biodegradation processes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1dd9a0647afad70038c8052c24eb5a67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3351564dbd6a0ee6a8b97f6687378ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc744f6fa5a9ea876a0423d37eedfc87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-412d934721b214c2cd0565531172171c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d97be338c51b4c4354e2d0f8de9c9dc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0e22d97687eaef3d31a60f7da6e668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b6237c84f002117fbfe7575d9cdd6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44e006d8af33633a06dac6789334329d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ISOTOPIC TESTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL REACTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Isotopic tests analyze isotopic composition to track chemical transformations and degradation pathways."&lt;SEP&gt;"Isotopic tests are analytical methods used to study the biodegradation and mineralization of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Isotopic tests are analytical methods used to trace the fate of materials through biochemical processes, aiding in understanding biodegradation mechanisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Isotopic tests are analytical methods used to track the fate of elements in biochemical or environmental processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tests using isotopes to trace and analyze chemical reactions and degradation processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Isotopic tests are used to track the fate of carbon atoms in polystyrene during its biodegradation by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Isotopic tests are used to track the fate of carbon atoms during the degradation of materials like polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Isotopic tests using $^{13}$C-labeled PS confirm the mineralization of polystyrene into $^{13}$CO2 and its incorporation into lipids."&lt;SEP&gt;"Isotopic tests are used to study the mineralization and degradation of substances like polystyrene in biological systems."&lt;SEP&gt;"Isotopic tests involve analyzing isotopes to confirm the biodegradation pathways of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tests that use isotopes to track or analyze the transformation of substances like polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Isotopic tests involve analyzing isotopes to track the biodegradation and mineralization of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Isotopic tests are used to study the breakdown and transformation of polystyrene during biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Techniques employed to track the mineralization and biodegradation of polystyrene by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Isotopic tests are analytical methods used to trace the fate of carbon and other elements during biodegradation processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Isotopic tests are used to track the breakdown and mineralization of polystyrene in biological systems."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1dd9a0647afad70038c8052c24eb5a67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7fa795762aa89809d8221dc9dda92fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3351564dbd6a0ee6a8b97f6687378ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e3058d086d89f1ce9baa29cbc29bb48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33f35f87c2ff7792eb41bdd8debdb5f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc744f6fa5a9ea876a0423d37eedfc87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-412d934721b214c2cd0565531172171c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21bee96879472a1c6df454d862dc9e90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a3d3cf8ea423f7e0f637dddade1bbf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-550dde13ffd2abcf536dd87f7d4c1b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d97be338c51b4c4354e2d0f8de9c9dc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0e22d97687eaef3d31a60f7da6e668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c7bcc9530f9dc72038f774f6f084ab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cede90fd3b3eee0bd12d582eaa7d54c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44e006d8af33633a06dac6789334329d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38283df790b03806f99ca90272a1000f</data>
    </node>
