      <data key="d1">"Digestion Process refers to the mechanism by which mealworms break down polystyrene within their gut."&lt;SEP&gt;"The digestion process in the intestine of mealworms involves complex interactions between microbiota and enzymatic activities for breaking down substances like PU."</data>
