      <data key="d0">"HEALTH MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A measure of the proportion of living larvae over time during the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Survival Rates measure the percentage of larvae surviving over a period, influenced by diet and nutritional intake."&lt;SEP&gt;"Survival rates indicate the ability of mealworms to survive on different diets, including plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Survival rates indicate the proportion of mealworms surviving under different dietary conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"SRs measure the survival of larvae over time, indicating their health and viability during experiments."</data>
