      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Studies using tracers to track the biooxidation and degradation of polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tracer studies involve the use of labeled compounds to track biochemical processes, such as the biodegradation of polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tracer studies involve the use of labeled compounds to track biological processes, such as the biooxidation of Ecolyte PS polystyrene."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-bf8041a3cdcd6091f6c96b8b67229df2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b27c93b39534612a0492f52ce1f3cd8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eada60ee606520104bb515c4896d6b0b</data>
