      <data key="d0">"BACTERIUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Erwinia oleae is a bacterium found in the gut microbiome of mealworms, aiding in the degradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Erwinia oleae is a bacterium identified by the strain DAPP-PG 531* and associated with specific gene sequences."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9f7eff62476fb3de27969b584ac3e605&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-014b72d0a2657cbc89c4dee5f2b32bba</data>
