      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL COMPOUND"</data>
      <data key="d1">"1,1-Diphenyl-ethylene acts as a structural marker in assessing PS degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A compound derived from plastic packaging identified in the biomass."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-30c4244cae75095bda7fb526c3d0c9d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de9904e6f38706256e15c7957f8f0527</data>
