    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROLLED BARLEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRITIONAL COMPONENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A dietary component provided to larvae in varying amounts during the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rolled barley is a dietary component provided to mealworm larvae during the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rolled barley is a primary component of the diet provided to T. molitor larvae during experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rolled barley serves as part of the larval diet in the experiment, providing essential nutrients such as protein and starch."</data>
