      <data key="d2">chunk-84f576487c8d473c1524eb1141730a12</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ETOH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ethanol (EtOH) is used to disinfect the external surface of larvae before collecting their internal microflora."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-84f576487c8d473c1524eb1141730a12</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MRD LIQUID&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"MRD liquid (Thermo Fisher) is a medium composed of peptone and sodium chloride, used to dilute the mixtures of larvae intestines and internal liquid."&lt;SEP&gt;"MRD liquid is a product used for diluting mixtures of larvae intestines and internal liquid, containing peptone and sodium chloride."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c83f95e0134b38f78f2624da01ab0f79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84f576487c8d473c1524eb1141730a12</data>
