      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"ATR-FTIR spectroscopy is a technique used to confirm the chemical nature of the PS samples."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-84f576487c8d473c1524eb1141730a12</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIFFERENTIAL SCANNING CALORIMETRY (DSC)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"DSC confirms the material properties of polystyrene, including its glass transition temperature."&lt;SEP&gt;"DSC is a thermal analysis method used to evaluate the glass transition temperature of PS samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"DSC measures heat flow associated with physical transitions in materials, indicating changes in the crystallinity of HDPE after degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6b4ab01931acbc7aa9c77cd03531c57e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84f576487c8d473c1524eb1141730a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02761f0aee6116a25ce05444f6ce8242</data>
    </node>
