      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL CHARACTERISTIC"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The glass transition temperature (100°C) confirms the identity and thermal properties of polystyrene samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"The glass transition temperature indicates the point at which a polymer transitions from a hard and relatively brittle state into a rubbery state."&lt;SEP&gt;"The glass transition temperature of polystyrene was confirmed at \(109^\circ \mathrm{C}\)."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-30c4244cae75095bda7fb526c3d0c9d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4ab01931acbc7aa9c77cd03531c57e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84f576487c8d473c1524eb1141730a12</data>
