    <node id="&quot;SOIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL FEATURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Soil is a natural body consisting of layers of material on the surface of the Earth, serving as a medium for plant growth and supporting diverse ecosystems."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soil is an ecological medium where many microorganisms capable of degrading plastics reside."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soil serves as a natural reservoir for microorganisms that can potentially contribute to the biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soil is the ecological source from which the novel bacterial consortium was isolated for studying polyurethane degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soil is the upper layer of earth in which plants grow, composed of organic matter, minerals, and microorganisms."</data>
