    <node id="&quot;PU1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A polyurethane kitchen sponge (PU1) containing significant amounts of calcium (Ca), aluminum (Al), silicon (Si), and chlorine (Cl)."&lt;SEP&gt;"PU1 (polyurethane 1) is a type of plastic included in the study to evaluate its consumption by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"PU1 (polyurethane foam 1) is a type of plastic foam that starts with a smooth, flat surface. After digestion by insects, its surface becomes significantly wrinkled."&lt;SEP&gt;"PU1 is a type of soft polyurethane (kitchen sponge) utilized by mealworms with 46.8% efficiency."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-065b846c5f5f23f64023995cdb21c3db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4b03ca32b0efbf0ca6a3c8761c0d03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fc215d3abb38f76b4ee0d22c4f1eb11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78cd8d4684fa9e0519635dba9f124a08</data>
    </node>
