      <data key="d1">"Mica is a mineral used as a stabilizer in plastics, contributing to surface stabilization."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-119b3f144b4ec234392cca17031bd7a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KAOLIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MINERAL"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kaolin is a clay mineral used for surface stabilization in some plastics."</data>
