      <data key="d2">chunk-98d7ae4d155085781614411da5564816</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IMAGO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LIFE STAGE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Imago refers to the adult stage in the life cycle of Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Imago represents the adult stage of insect development, which is active in consuming plastics alongside larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Imago represents the adult stage of mealworms, showing minimal mass changes compared to larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Imago refers to the adult stage of T. molitor, which produces fewer eggs when fed PS foam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Imago refers to the adult stage of an insect's life cycle."&lt;SEP&gt;"Imago refers to the adult stage of the T. molitor beetle after completing its metamorphosis from the larval stage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Imago refers to the adult stage of the mealworm's life cycle."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d6a80044bea074bdbcb68f489aa8af0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-697bf99ecf19f99243f3b5a4ef5b334c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02f21478b87845df31740b3dab37d197&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d7ae4d155085781614411da5564816&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3cec3addc1bee202783dff1583ba54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a11793261251544a542146bc9bf0c5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32f340b7166025be3c56178a94ae480d</data>
    </node>
