      <data key="d1">"Vulcanized SBR (styrene-butadiene rubber) is a type of rubber that can be biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vulcanized SBR refers to crosslinked styrene-butadiene rubber, which can also be degraded by certain insect larvae."</data>
