    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TIRE CRUMB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tire crumb is recycled rubber material derived from tires, targeted for biodegradation studies involving insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tire crumb refers to recycled rubber from tires, which can also be biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-bfd8d6b8105d9868a4ffadf5779d0df5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-032b3b0fe0366e6e76e86abf8c48d200</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENZYMATIC PROFILE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The enzymatic profile characterizes the specific enzymes produced by organisms such as Tenebrio molitor larvae during biodegradation processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The enzymatic profile describes the set of enzymes involved in the biodegradation process within the gut microbiome of Tenebrio monitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"The enzymatic profile refers to the set of enzymes produced by organisms involved in the breakdown of specific substrates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The enzymatic profile refers to the collection of enzymes produced by the gut microbiota of Tenebrio molitor larvae during biodegradation processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The enzymatic profile represents the set of enzymes present in an organism's system that facilitate various biochemical reactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The enzymatic profile represents the range of enzymes produced by organisms involved in breaking down plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"The enzymatic profile represents the specific set of enzymes produced by an organism, which can influence its ability to degrade plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"The enzymatic profile refers to the set of enzymes expressed by Tenebrio molitor larvae during waste degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3351564dbd6a0ee6a8b97f6687378ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfbd751517e11b1b4052961a01008cbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfd8d6b8105d9868a4ffadf5779d0df5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56af93e805daf3987d95ff99ab8e891d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-767a2e5a2bde762f9c1b3dbbf7746d09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5073433ee060ce75e140a6626619108b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd2f7b94f62fa18de9e02426577d241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38283df790b03806f99ca90272a1000f</data>
    </node>
