      <data key="d1">"Sewage sludge contains lipids that can be fractionated and converted into biodiesel."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sewage sludge from wastewater treatment plants contains microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sewage sludge is a substrate where microplastics undergo enhanced biodegradation through hyperthermophilic composting technology."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sewage sludge contains microplastics that can be mitigated through processes such as pyrolysis."</data>
