      <data key="d1">"Biodegradable plastics contribute to environmental safety by reducing persistent pollution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental safety involves reducing the impact of plastic waste on ecosystems through effective biodegradation techniques."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental safety pertains to the assessment of whether the biodegradation process poses risks to ecosystems."</data>
