      <data key="d1">"Hylocereus undatus, also known as dragon fruit cacti, is a hardy plant used as an indicator species for testing the effects of worm frass on plant growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hylocereus undatus, commonly known as dragon fruit cacti, were used in grafting experiments to study the effects of worm frass."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-671dc96f9c648fdc6d21397c515d171d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44565f26e7290c5eb0f26935608a5f16</data>
