      <data key="d2">chunk-671dc96f9c648fdc6d21397c515d171d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;USED TEA LEAVES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Used tea leaves are employed as a positive control in plant growth experiments, serving as a media for grafting."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-671dc96f9c648fdc6d21397c515d171d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DICHLOROMETHANE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A solvent used for redissolving filtrate in PS degradation product analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"A solvent used to prepare polystyrene emulsion for microbial degradation experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dichloromethane is a solvent used for dissolving plastic pellets in the preparation of polymer emulsions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dichloromethane is a solvent used for extracting PE polymers from frass samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dichloromethane is a solvent used to dissolve PS balls, frass, and worm carcasses for GC-MS analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dichloromethane is a solvent used to dissolve plastic pellets during the preparation of polymer emulsions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dichloromethane is a solvent used for extracting PE samples during HT-GPC analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dichloromethane is a solvent used to dissolve EPS during PS film preparation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dichloromethane is a solvent used to dissolve PS foams during the preparation of the PS emulsion."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fdb13eda4d3cf5385a0a8284c7e213b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c808bc1867233246c6ad41186de9452&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68041096d198a27b4ed526281746b7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11de08c24a626abb11d37d71e9567e2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-671dc96f9c648fdc6d21397c515d171d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-326aabc25dd967951a7845ea221532ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ada834fc8d4bea41c0ce1770d6f57e4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-220952ca1d34f3ffef65c5d71e22015e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96c2e7d253d2108b0ed94be7f2dc7466</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TEFLON FILTERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Teflon filters with 0.45 μm pore size are used to filter solvent-soluble fractions during GC-MS analysis."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-671dc96f9c648fdc6d21397c515d171d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HP 6890 GAS CHROMATOGRAPHY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"HP 6890 gas chromatography is part of the analytical system used for detecting PS and its by-products."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-671dc96f9c648fdc6d21397c515d171d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HP-5MS COLUMN&quot;">
