      <data key="d2">chunk-12ceb4368e146509caa737d9534ce3c2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GC-MS ANALYSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"GC-MS (Gas Chromatography-Mass Spectrometry) is a technique used to analyze the degradation products of microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS analysis determines the fatty acid content in larval samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS analysis is a method used to detect chemicals in superworm and mealworm frass, identifying growth-promoting compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS analysis is a process used to detect chemical compounds in worm frass, identifying metabolites and by-products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gas chromatography-mass spectrometry technique used to identify metabolic intermediates during PS metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS analysis is a technique used to identify chemical compounds in samples, such as additives in plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gas chromatography-mass spectrometry (GC-MS) is used to analyze the degradation products of microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gas Chromatography-Mass Spectrometry analysis used to characterize plasticizer contents in tested PS and PE foams."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a52fc2936b4d2a771dbc2d6a37eeb710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078b6698be699eb7105b7cffadf709af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-582f48080aab075de76c9c590558639f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40357516e3f9dd4b2969b73efe444c28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0881f766e34a5d97ee711cd2edd793f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12ceb4368e146509caa737d9534ce3c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31ad3152e855d5b8085e1e61af57515d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STYRENE PEAKS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL REACTION BYPRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Styrene peaks were detected in positive controls but not significantly in worm frass, indicating limited styrene production."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-12ceb4368e146509caa737d9534ce3c2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FATTY ACID PRIMARY AMIDES (FAPAS)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLITE"</data>
