      <data key="d0">"COMPOUND"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nonadecane is an alkane compound detected in the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nonadecane is another short-chain alkene semiochemical detected in GC-MS analysis, contributing to growth promotion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nonadecane is another short-chain alkene semiochemical detected in superworm frass that may contribute to growth promotion."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-aa64e5cd2c08637934509262e56ab363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44565f26e7290c5eb0f26935608a5f16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078b6698be699eb7105b7cffadf709af</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OCTADECANE&quot;">
