      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"XRD is a technique used to determine the crystal structure of materials, applied here to analyze frass samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"XRD measures the crystal structure changes in frass, indicating transformations in microplastic composition."&lt;SEP&gt;"XRD is a technique used to determine the crystalline structure of materials, showing a decrease in relative crystallinity of HDPE after bacterial treatment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c651f9305c4265540ed7deeb891eae71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02761f0aee6116a25ce05444f6ce8242</data>
