      <data key="d1">"TGA analyzes the thermochemical properties of materials, used here to study the thermal stability of frass and microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"TGA analyzes thermal stability and decomposition patterns of frass and microplastics, revealing their thermochemical properties."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c651f9305c4265540ed7deeb891eae71</data>
