      <data key="d2">chunk-1e45f9527e7b07e945435dae572dc387</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENERGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLIC MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Energy refers to the capacity for growth and biological activity in organisms like mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The energy obtained from the degradation and metabolism of PP polymers utilized by T. molitor larvae for living activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Energy represents the metabolic output derived from plastic consumption by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Energy refers to the metabolic fuel derived from the digestion of products like PP, necessary for larval life activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Energy refers to the capacity to perform work, essential for the survival and growth of mealworm larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1e45f9527e7b07e945435dae572dc387&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-181e2c8b4d78916fefcf87c119f11d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3092744be0c66dad5833977dedd913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77a9d70651c9f13362e4c1e3ce10eab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53f87a406d4812c07e783e6cbfc09606</data>
    </node>
