    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CROSS-LINKING REACTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL REACTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A chemical process where polymers form covalent bonds, leading to changes in molecular weight distribution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cross-linking reaction is a process that may occur in the low molecular fraction of polymers, leading to changes in Mn and Mw values."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-236f4db8df75799fa6a0a07921158cf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e50d86c5a0ab8e4188ede9ae519d241</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MN (NUMBER-AVERAGE MOLECULAR WEIGHT)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLIC MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A measure of the average molecular weight of polymer chains, here used to describe PP foam properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"A measure of the average molecular weight of polymer chains, used to assess degradation or cross-linking reactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mn represents the average molecular weight based on the number of molecules, used to assess biodegradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f8ee8f544a1849c80a5a1524c4f2674c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdc8398efba587929eebd0a0842f6e69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e50d86c5a0ab8e4188ede9ae519d241</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MW (WEIGHT-AVERAGE MOLECULAR WEIGHT)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLIC MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A measure of the average molecular weight of polymer chains weighted by their mass, describing PP foam properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"A measure of the weighted average molecular weight of polymer chains, used to assess degradation or cross-linking reactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mw represents the average molecular weight weighted by the mass of molecules, providing insights into polymer degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f8ee8f544a1849c80a5a1524c4f2674c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdc8398efba587929eebd0a0842f6e69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e50d86c5a0ab8e4188ede9ae519d241</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TG–DTG CURVE&quot;">
