      <data key="d0">"PROGRAM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"R&amp;D Program for Forest Science Technology is a project supporting research on forest science and technology, including this study on polystyrene degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"R&amp;D Program for Forest Science Technology is a research initiative supporting advancements in forest science."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7734a37a076c4f934de059042daf10cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-126ff1ea4b1c89f82a750386be59f926</data>
