      <data key="d1">"Microbial Biodegradation refers to the breakdown of substances by microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial biodegradation involves the use of microorganisms to break down plastics like polystyrene into simpler compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial biodegradation involves the breakdown of organic materials by microorganisms, including those present in the gut microbiome of mealworms."</data>
