      <data key="d0">"METABOLITE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A potential end product of complete mineralization of polystyrene through microbial biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"CO2 is a byproduct of the biodegradation process where yellow mealworms convert plastics into simpler compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Carbon dioxide is a gaseous product formed during the biodegradation of polystyrene by mealworms."</data>
