    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INCINERATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Incineration involves burning plastic waste, which can lead to secondary pollution and toxic emissions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Incineration is an abiotic method used for destroying plastic waste, though it may cause air pollution and hazardous by-products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Incineration is the process of burning waste at high temperatures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Incineration is a traditional method for disposing of plastic waste, involving the burning of plastics at high temperatures."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-697bf99ecf19f99243f3b5a4ef5b334c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f91ffc7c76e8e0a1757d91f7cf62f568&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2359b10600f30376fe077f5e942cc999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6aab9d327fcd7d10b5d4fbb22c03292a</data>
    </node>
