      <data key="d1">"Petroleum-based plastics are derived from crude oil and include materials such as polyethylene and polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Petroleum-based plastics are synthetic materials derived from fossil fuels, known for their recalcitrance to degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Petroleum-based plastics are synthetic materials derived from petroleum, characterized by their durability and resistance to degradation."</data>
