    <node id="&quot;HYDROQUINONE PEROXIDASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hydroquinone Peroxidase is an enzyme secreted by Azotobacter beijerinckii HM121 for the enzymatic degradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydroquinone peroxidase is an enzyme from Azotobacter beijerinckii HM21 that plays a role in degrading polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydroquinone peroxidase is an enzyme involved in the enzymatic degradation of polystyrene by certain bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydroquinone peroxidase is an enzyme involved in the enzymatic degradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydroquinone peroxidase is an enzyme secreted by Azotobacter beijerinckii HM121 for degrading polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydroquinone Peroxidase produced by Azotobacter beijerinckii HM121 can degrade polystyrene in a dichloromethane-water system."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-effe1e87d51e126ff4ec5cf9e49d6524&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-630d06d8ab372b4cadd7e3772d8fa1fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b4b45d826a6a7956015e680f5fb8ee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38a07d29ecfa06f82d97e69f5cd2c801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df4c8c66bfbbfc37ed842f53d2b8796c</data>
    </node>
