      <data key="d2">chunk-c42631c88da011b836666dae04cfa11a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRAN DIET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A control diet consisting of bran, used for comparison with the PU diet in studying mealworm gut microbiome changes."&lt;SEP&gt;"A nutrient-rich diet fed to mealworms for comparison with PU diet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran diet is one of the three diets tested in the study, which influences the microbiome composition of Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"A diet containing bran, which has been shown to influence the gut microbiome of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran diet is one of the dietary components provided to the insects during the experiment."</data>
