    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PS DIET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DIET"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A diet based on polystyrene, influencing nitrogen conversion and amino acid synthesis."&lt;SEP&gt;"A diet based on polystyrene, which correlates positively with the first ordination axis and is negatively correlated with the presence of Clostridium bacteria in larvae and the number of imagines."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS Diet has unique effects on bacterial orders like Nitrosomonadales and Planctomycetales."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS diet is one of the three diets tested in the study, consisting of polystyrene, which influences the microbiome composition of Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"A diet consisting of polystyrene (PS), used in experiments to observe its effects on the gut microbiome of Tenebrio larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS diet refers to a diet consisting of polystyrene, which may affect T. molitor larvae through insufficient food supply and toxic effects."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e819d53f76bcab4b74eba714efd32163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0e30f29e9016acae216566f53e60cea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f65bf081bdd3c6718fa0310993bfc0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88706f91768bcf0eaa7a49ef2d4b771f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c42631c88da011b836666dae04cfa11a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84297b844ec01d2f58756b669806fd62</data>
    </node>
