      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"EPS Foam is another type of PS foam known for higher permeability and better productivity effects on mealworms than XPS foam."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPS foam is a type of polystyrene with over 98% purity used in the experiments for microbial degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Expanded polystyrene foam (EPS) is a type of PS used in biodegradation studies."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPS foam is another type of polystyrene foam waste used as a feed source for mealworms."</data>
