    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PE-1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A specific type of polyethylene used as feedstock in the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE-1 is a pink-colored LDPE foam used in the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE-1 is a sample of low-density polyethylene (LDPE) used in experiments to study its depolymerization by Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE-1 is a type of LDPE foam used in experiments, showing significant depolymerization after passage through the larval gut."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE-1 is a type of polymer used in the study to evaluate depolymerization by the larvae."</data>
