      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Another type of polyethylene used as feedstock in the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE-2 is a colorless LDPE film without additives, used in biodegradation studies."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE-2 is another LDPE foam variant with a distinct depolymerization pattern compared to PE-1."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE-2 is another sample of low-density polyethylene (LDPE) used in experiments to study its depolymerization by Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE-2 is another type of polymer tested for its depolymerization potential by the larvae."</data>
