    <node id="&quot;GENTAMICIN SULFATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ANTIBIOTIC"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An antibiotic tested for its ability to suppress gut bacteria in T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"An antibiotic used to suppress gut bacteria in larvae, administered at a ratio of 100:3 (w/w) with bran."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gentamicin Sulfate is an antibiotic purchased from Aladdin and used in microbiological assays."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gentamicin sulfate is an antibiotic used to suppress microbial activity during the biodegradation tests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gentamicin sulfate is an antibiotic used to suppress microbial activity in the larvae during the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gentamicin sulfate is an antibiotic used to suppress the gut microbiome in experimental conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sulfate salt of gentamicin used as an antibiotic in the suppression test."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gentamicin sulfate is an antibiotic used to suppress gut microbiota in T. molitor and Z. atratus larvae, reducing bacterial activity and affecting PP degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8bb63b06976c3a8e6f2cea85c1ecf518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd90c8f9754a78aabdbd7053e1adf90b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3099f2d6fd3abc2f73550f579999b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85c9587b55f24a8ae5ba6b478dbb98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e96b716e9400e9e77e099de5cca7c548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f28f1c36076d1f249dbc4cd67b16f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11de08c24a626abb11d37d71e9567e2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-449dceb5649c6baa34ecc2218cd3e9e1</data>
    </node>
