    <node id="&quot;UPARSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A software tool used for clustering sequences into OTUs based on sequence similarity thresholds."&lt;SEP&gt;"UPARSE clusters operational taxonomic units (OTUs) from sequencing data at a 97% identity threshold."&lt;SEP&gt;"UPARSE is a bioinformatics process used to cluster OTUs with a 97% identity threshold."&lt;SEP&gt;"UPARSE is software used for clustering sequences into OTUs based on sequence identity thresholds."&lt;SEP&gt;"UPARSE is an algorithm designed to generate highly accurate Operational Taxonomic Unit (OTU) sequences from microbial amplicon reads."&lt;SEP&gt;"UPARSE is a computational tool designed for generating highly accurate Operational Taxonomic Unit (OTU) sequences from microbial amplicon reads."&lt;SEP&gt;"Uparse is a software tool used for clustering sequences into operational taxonomic units (OTUs)."&lt;SEP&gt;"UPARSE is a computational method for processing and clustering high-throughput sequencing data to identify operational taxonomic units (OTUs)."&lt;SEP&gt;"UPARSE is a software tool used for clustering operational taxonomic units (OTUs) with a 97% identity threshold."&lt;SEP&gt;"UPARSE is software used for clustering operational taxonomic units (OTUs) based on sequence similarity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Software tool used for clustering sequences into OTUs during microbial community analysis."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a38c714e7f1f701ec1149e25910e16e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7f79551ab9793788cd662ab66bca5ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d27c41781c64c2b407faecc4bc31466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d908d878ed4e7fc36f3af71a5be7f2ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df147b253e29abfa812d060407051e45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85c9587b55f24a8ae5ba6b478dbb98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f28f1c36076d1f249dbc4cd67b16f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41af774fc28352c7dd95d8c3cb43f855&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76cb64e0aa4e4039b70799a0df8943d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-449dceb5649c6baa34ecc2218cd3e9e1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UCHIME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Software tool used for identifying and removing chimeric sequences during microbial community analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"UCHIME identifies and removes chimeric sequences from PCR-amplified DNA samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"UCHIME is a computational tool used to identify and remove chimeric sequences from the data."&lt;SEP&gt;"UCHIME is an advanced algorithm that enhances the sensitivity and speed of chimera detection in bioinformatics."&lt;SEP&gt;"UCHIME is a chimera detection algorithm that enhances sensitivity and speed in identifying chimeric sequences in microbial studies."&lt;SEP&gt;"UCHIME is a software tool used to identify and remove chimeric sequences from sequencing data."&lt;SEP&gt;"UCHIME is a tool used for identifying and removing chimeric sequences from amplicon data."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a38c714e7f1f701ec1149e25910e16e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7f79551ab9793788cd662ab66bca5ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3667703f7416ebab666e65b375dd8582&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df147b253e29abfa812d060407051e45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f28f1c36076d1f249dbc4cd67b16f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76cb64e0aa4e4039b70799a0df8943d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-449dceb5649c6baa34ecc2218cd3e9e1</data>
    </node>
