      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A measure of the average molecular weight of polymers, indicating polymer degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Molecular weight measures the size of polymer chains, which change during the degradation process of plastics in mealworm guts."</data>
