      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A measure used to describe the average molecular weight of polymers during degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"\(M_n\) represents the average molecular weight of polystyrene, with a value of approximately 100,000 in this study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Number-average molecular weight represents the average molecular weight calculated using the number of molecules in a polymer sample."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d5dc0ba5d8a1abfb746af0dedb7d575b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4ab01931acbc7aa9c77cd03531c57e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76783f53d38e8c7423dff747f0413d8</data>
