    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIGNIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL COMPONENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A complex organic polymer found in plant cell walls, resistant to degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Complex organic polymers present in bran, degraded by T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a complex organic polymer found in the cell walls of many plants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a complex organic polymer found in plant cell walls, serving as a substrate for enzymatic degradation processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a complex organic polymer found in plant cell walls, structurally similar to some synthetic plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a complex polymer found in plant cell walls, degraded through enzymatic processes involving peroxidases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a complex polymer in plant cell walls, poorly digested by larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a complex organic polymer deposited in the cell walls of many plants, providing structural support."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a complex organic polymer found in plant materials, which T. molitor larvae can degrade."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-effe1e87d51e126ff4ec5cf9e49d6524&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-158317f8eba5f6198135df044d385935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfe58fb1bbaa5c35e9c6c837d0b1050f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d39fc863538a777920c4eafb37bcf8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfa5755e6c9a5eeae3f595d901dff422&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5dc0ba5d8a1abfb746af0dedb7d575b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc6c2706bd609f920aa61d5ef2310db6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e540abd667582c77f4d2222836147ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db579d338d8f90574e3ac67a3ae9938d</data>
    </node>
