    <node id="&quot;BLAST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A bioinformatics tool used for aligning sequences with organisms present in the GenBank database."&lt;SEP&gt;"BLAST (Basic Local Alignment Search Tool) is a bioinformatics tool used for comparing biological sequences to identify regions of similarity."&lt;SEP&gt;"BLAST (Basic Local Alignment Search Tool) is used to compare 16S rRNA gene sequences against existing databases."&lt;SEP&gt;"BLAST is a sequence similarity search tool used to identify strains by comparing them against the NCBI 16s rRNA database."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bioinformatics tool used for comparing nucleotide sequences against a database."&lt;SEP&gt;"BLAST (Basic Local Alignment Search Tool) is used to compare nucleotide sequences and identify similarities between isolates and known species."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bioinformatics tool used for strain identification based on sequence similarity."&lt;SEP&gt;"BLAST is a bioinformatics process used for sequence alignment and comparison, which has been improved by the UCHIME algorithm."&lt;SEP&gt;"A bioinformatics tool used to align sequences with organisms present in the GenBank database."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d99a98d885ec6495c4dc902866c4ab9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68041096d198a27b4ed526281746b7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aface14c9ee7dd5ccd25e7094ed5c1c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e9eb740edf53e540b468122b302cb82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-050a4c71685bf71165985a79f528ed58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3667703f7416ebab666e65b375dd8582&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70bab3579af07d0f99a5f948a90fe1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f488d8d4434d57d1a775a22333caa04b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-652bf0615ec39fba0cedd113ec87a78a</data>
