    <node id="&quot;PLASTIC BIO-OXIDATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Plastic Bio-Oxidation involves the biological degradation of plastics through oxidation mechanisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic bio-oxidation involves the biological degradation of plastics by microorganisms into simpler compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The bio-oxidation of plastics involves microbial processes that break down plastic materials into simpler compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The breakdown of plastics through biological oxidation processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic bio-oxidation is the biological degradation process where microorganisms break down plastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fa27760a0a889fe7b58360dbb150cdf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a31a12c930b59b872c94dda484d0db4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a53d37e7ff6850fc55177f325e49861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-908b8bfa7e446694958cf9bd0cfbc583</data>
