      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Processed Polystyrene refers to polystyrene material commercially available for parcels. Its effects on mealworm growth were studied."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a11793261251544a542146bc9bf0c5dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECYCLED POLYSTYRENE (PSR)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Recycled Polystyrene is derived from the recycling process and was included in the study to evaluate its influence on mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recycled polystyrene is a processed form of polystyrene used in the experiment, showing limited accessibility for mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a11793261251544a542146bc9bf0c5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2281f98bcfd555a703fd86232dfa42fb</data>
    </node>
