      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Post hoc Tukey HSD test is used after an ANOVA to identify which specific groups differ from each other."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a11793261251544a542146bc9bf0c5dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PACKING POLYSTYRENE (PSP)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Packing polystyrene is used for packaging purposes and was tested for hardness and mass loss effects on mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a11793261251544a542146bc9bf0c5dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BACTERIAL COUNTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bacterial counts refer to the number of bacteria present in different groups of mealworms, indicating potential microbial interactions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a11793261251544a542146bc9bf0c5dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WORLD PLASTIC PRODUCTION&quot;">
