      <data key="d1">"Cutadapt is a software tool used to identify and remove adapter sequences from raw sequencing reads."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cutadapt is a software tool used to remove sequencing adapters from raw reads."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cutadapt is software used for trimming adapters and quality filtering of raw sequence reads."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-31b36e69e51416db099951b925beff9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d27c41781c64c2b407faecc4bc31466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c426315f0f412528b9c6fb2a82dff2c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PENG ET AL., 2020&quot;">
