      <data key="d1">"GPC results refer to data obtained from gel permeation chromatography, indicating the molecular weight distribution of PE during degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"GPC results refer to gel permeation chromatography data, which show shifts in molecular weight distribution during the biodegradation process."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dbc20d6948e6ca1157ecd7f80a183952&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78830eb6f2457838fda4728b21c17bed</data>
    </node>
