      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hydrophobic PE describes the water-repellent nature of polyethylene, making it difficult for microorganisms to physically approach and colonize."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-78830eb6f2457838fda4728b21c17bed</data>
    </node>
