      <data key="d1">"A soil bacterium contributes to the biodegradation of polyethylene, either naturally or when combined with recombinant cells expressing AlkB enzyme."&lt;SEP&gt;"A soil bacterium is a microorganism found in soil environments, capable of participating in biodegradation processes."</data>
