      <data key="d2">chunk-fa9972450967f344c19cb747d7ce649e</data>
      <data key="d1">"Alkane hydroxylase enzymes expressed in E. coli BL21 demonstrate activity on low molecular weight polyethylene, contributing to its breakdown."</data>
