      <data key="d1">"Rhodococcus ruber C208 benefits from UV irradiation pretreatment, improving its ability to degrade branched low-density polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"UV irradiation involves exposing materials to ultraviolet light to induce degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"UV irradiation refers to the exposure of materials to ultraviolet light to induce degradation."</data>
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
    </node>
