    <node id="&quot;HOMOGENATE PASTE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A substance created by homogenizing larvae, used in experiments to study biochemical degradation mechanisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Homogenate paste is a processed mixture of greater wax moth larvae used in experiments to test degradation capability without live larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Homogenate paste is a substance derived from the greater wax moth larvae, used in experiments to test its effect on LDPE degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Homogenate paste refers to a mixture containing microbes that are applied to the LDPE substrate to induce degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2a214d2b1c90aeb78e6e8562679d4963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b08485bef3ee3db21e59e159ad4c3e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16700b183fc641abfa74ad7fbb0917fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-681ece0a8beca8b22f3c6aa11a564f63</data>
