      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A mineral oil used in experiments involving mixing with homogenate paste to study degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liquid paraffin is mixed with homogenate paste to study its interaction with microbial activity over 14 days."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liquid paraffin was used as a control medium in homogenate experiments to observe microbial activity at high humidity."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b08485bef3ee3db21e59e159ad4c3e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16700b183fc641abfa74ad7fbb0917fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98a6f770f1d3a35f8611c5f2516c1e08</data>
