      <data key="d1">"CO2-eq. represents carbon dioxide equivalent, a measure of greenhouse gas emissions used to evaluate environmental impacts."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e6d515521d6d2b72e82154cc544d26cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOW S DIESEL&quot;">
