    <node id="&quot;INFRARED SPECTROSCOPY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Infrared spectroscopy is a technique used to analyze chemical changes in LDPE substrates after exposure to larvae or homogenate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Infrared spectroscopy is a technique used to identify chemical bonds, employed here to detect molecular changes in polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Infrared spectroscopy is a technique used to identify changes in the chemical structure of materials, such as HDPE during biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Infrared spectroscopy was utilized to determine the material composition of residual plastics."</data>
