      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Light intensity affects the activity and effectiveness of mealworms in biodegrading plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Light intensity impacts the sensitivity of mealworms and is measured using lux meters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Light intensity is a physical property that impacts the intake capacity and growth of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Light intensity is an environmental parameter influencing mealworm intake capacity and growth during plastic degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-503c588468d284ba03a34235957f9b02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2fb515eae7af2b662d5d600120e7001&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88659f9848d30be72c37a99b551a9a0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-196a7570e6cac531e94c1680c54f5491</data>
