    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LARVAL STAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LIFE STAGE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The larval stage is a specific developmental phase in the life cycle of holometabolous insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"The larval stage is the developmental phase of mealworms during which they actively consume and degrade plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"The larval stage of \( T. molitor \) is responsible for significant EPS degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The larval stage is the developmental phase where waxworms prefer to eat, indicating their primary feeding period."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-069f8447676509ffdd0028e9c05fb9ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f2303f3680e9313daac77bb7e27e7da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-196a7570e6cac531e94c1680c54f5491&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eee7e44e4c15567a057d7d295d240211</data>
    </node>
