      <data key="d1">"Nutrients are substances required for growth and development, aiding in the biodegradation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nutrients such as oats, apple slices, carrot, and potato enhance the growth conditions of mealworms during their larvae period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nutrients are substances required for growth, energy, and maintenance in living organisms, which may be studied in the context of mealworms as a food source."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-503c588468d284ba03a34235957f9b02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2fb515eae7af2b662d5d600120e7001&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35eed7e10fb1cc08baaecab1b1cffad0</data>
