    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BLOOD AGAR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Blood Agar is a nutrient medium used for culturing microorganisms, composed of peptone, beef extract/yeast extract, agar, NaCl, sheep blood, and distilled water with a pH range of 7.2 to 7.6."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blood agar is a specific type of culture medium composed of peptone, beef extract, agar, NaCl, distilled water, and sheep blood."</data>
