      <data key="d1">"An incubator is a controlled environment used to maintain specific temperature and humidity conditions for experiments involving mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"An incubator is used to maintain stable environmental conditions for mealworms when deviations occur."&lt;SEP&gt;"Incubators are containers used to house larvae during the biodegradation experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Incubators are devices used to maintain specific temperature and humidity conditions for raising mealworms and beetles."</data>
