    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BACILLUS SUBTILIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BACTERIUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bacillus Subtilis is another bacterium found in the mealworm gut, contributing to plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bacillus subtilis is a bacterium utilized in experiments to degrade polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bacillus subtilis is a species of bacteria known for producing surfactants that enhance PE degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bacillus subtilis is a soil bacterium involved in the biodegradation of various types of plastic waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bacillus subtilis is a bacterium involved in the biodegradation of polyethylene."</data>
