    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOW MOLECULAR-WEIGHT PRODUCTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLITE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Low molecular-weight products result from the depolymerization of polystyrene within the superworms' guts."</data>
