    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TG-FTIR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL REACTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"TG-FTIR combines thermogravimetric analysis with Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy to characterize the thermal properties of Styrofoam and frass."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thermogravimetric Analysis coupled with FTIR identifies thermal decomposition products of plastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5b7c2ef16f6809388c0c1a87c26bd5c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1498160e7767dd16008724d09b2ac64</data>
