      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A TG analyzer evaluates thermal properties of fecula and Styrofoam under nitrogen atmosphere."&lt;SEP&gt;"A TG analyzer measures weight loss of samples during thermal decomposition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thermogravimetric analyzer is used to characterize thermal properties of materials, specifically frass from mealworms fed plastics."</data>
