      <data key="d2">chunk-b8b7b5a840af17cee78d71347e532d51</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ESEM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"ESEM (environment scanning electron microscope) is used to observe the morphology of microorganisms on the gut wall of superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental Scanning Electron Microscopy used to observe bacterial cells in mealworm gut content."</data>
