      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An elemental analyzer determines the carbon content of Styrofoam and frass samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"An elemental analyzer measures carbon content in dried worm biomass and fecula."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-81552b76a273b31cc2bd9ed21ed7a919&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8b7b5a840af17cee78d71347e532d51</data>
