      <data key="d1">"Nuclear Magnetic Resonance (NMR) is a spectroscopic technique used to identify chemical compositions, showing changes in the chemical structure of Styrofoam during degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-be41a05c5e519995f6622e2258511b70</data>
    </node>
