    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLYSTYRENE (PS)">
      <data key="d0">METABOLITE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Polystyrene (PS) is the primary component of Styrofoam, which undergoes biodegradation in the guts of superworms."</data>
