      <data key="d0">"METABOLITE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Phenyl derivatives are another class of metabolites potentially resulting from PS breakdown."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phenyl derivatives are low molecular weight products generated during the degradation of polystyrene in the frass."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phenyl derivatives are possible proxies for fragments or smaller molecules produced during the depolymerization/oxidation of PS."</data>
