    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STYRENE">
      <data key="d0">CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Styrene is a chemical compound that undergoes microbial degradation, involving biochemistry and molecular genetics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Styrene is the main thermal decomposition product of polystyrene, identified in the FTIR analysis of Styrofoam."</data>
