    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CARBON MONOXIDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL REACTION PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Carbon monoxide is a gas evolved during the thermal decomposition of lower molecular weight degradation products of PS."&lt;SEP&gt;"Carbon monoxide is one of the decomposition products identified in the fecula, formed within the temperature range of 175 to 480°C."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-497648a1cf8e41fac896250ae1eebbb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33a0a8b02ff930ea552c8902e4d0defd</data>
