    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TG/DTG CURVE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The TG/DTG curve represents thermogravimetric analysis and its derivative, showing weight loss stages during thermal decomposition."</data>
