    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROMETHIS VALGIPES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BACTERIUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Promethis valgipes is a species of beetle similar to Tenebrio molitor, often compared in studies involving DNA barcoding and taxonomy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Promethis valgipes is an insect species similar to Tenebrio molitor, often distinguished using DNA barcoding techniques."</data>
