    <node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FIELD OF STUDY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A field of study focused on understanding interactions between organisms and their environment, including processes like biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental science encompasses interdisciplinary studies aimed at understanding the interactions between organisms and their environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental science encompasses studies related to interactions between organisms and their environment, including plastic degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8cede90fd3b3eee0bd12d582eaa7d54c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5261cecf34dd62f3f6ee6f6c3e7834&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0e22d97687eaef3d31a60f7da6e668</data>
