      <data key="d1">"Zophobas rugipes is another name for Zophobas atratus, a species of beetle larvae often confused with other similar species."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8cede90fd3b3eee0bd12d582eaa7d54c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MINERALISATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mineralisation is the process where organic materials are converted into inorganic compounds through microbial activity."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8cede90fd3b3eee0bd12d582eaa7d54c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RADIOLABELED COMPOUND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Radiolabeled compounds, such as [14C] polystyrene, are used to trace biochemical processes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8cede90fd3b3eee0bd12d582eaa7d54c</data>
