    <node id="&quot;OCTADECANOIC ACID&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FATTY ACID"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A fatty acid detected in the gut of larvae during PS metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"A saturated fatty acid detected in the frass, showing decreased levels in PS-fed mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Octadecanoic acid (stearic acid) is another metabolite detected in the larvae tissue."&lt;SEP&gt;"Octadecanoic acid, also known as stearic acid, exhibits reduced excretion in Diets 1, 2, and 3 compared to the control diet."</data>
