      <data key="d1">"Fat body in insects is responsible for energy storage and metabolism regulation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The fat body in greater wax moth larvae metabolizes LDPE, highlighting metabolic consequences of plastic ingestion."&lt;SEP&gt;"The fat body in insects serves as a metabolic organ, playing a role in lipid storage and homeostasis."&lt;SEP&gt;"The fat body in insects is an organ responsible for storing nutrients, including lipids, and plays a key role in metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fat body is an organ in insects where lipids and other reserves are stored."</data>
