      <data key="d1">"Colonies refer to groups of microorganisms growing on a surface, such as agar or polystyrene sheets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Colonies refer to visible microbial growth observed on nutrient plates inoculated with strain YT2."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5318125e74217718b470b7721d1d6365&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06ba9ca61fb4f42582bbf7bd00ff0005</data>
    </node>
