      <data key="d2">chunk-37f447b9d6a8b38f80be0854c9c294af</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HIGH IMPACT POLYSTYRENE (HIPS)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A type of e-plastic containing decabromodiphenyl oxide and antimony trioxide."&lt;SEP&gt;"HIPS is a type of polystyrene with added rubber for improved strength and toughness."&lt;SEP&gt;"High Impact Polystyrene (HIPS) is an e-plastic containing decabromodiphenyl oxide and antimony trioxide, subject to microbial degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"High Impact Polystyrene (HIPS) is a type of polystyrene with added rubber for improved strength, commonly used in electronic applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"High Impact Polystyrene is an e-plastic containing additives like decabromodiphenyl oxide and antimony trioxide, which can be degraded by microbes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0f2fd4b2e978e6745e0dde602114a826&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-014a80fd61677e73708fa28913d7fc56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37f447b9d6a8b38f80be0854c9c294af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56425bd62513be46b9165bfd84f0dd0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63813cc5cb4812528045bd8f1ced4313</data>
    </node>
