      <data key="d2">chunk-37f447b9d6a8b38f80be0854c9c294af</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DECABROMODIPHENYL OXIDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TOXIN"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A flame retardant compound used in plastics like HIPS."&lt;SEP&gt;"Decabromodiphenyl oxide is a flame retardant additive commonly used in high impact polystyrene (HIPS) products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Decabromodiphenyl oxide is a flame retardant additive found in high impact polystyrene (HIPS)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Decabromodiphenyl oxide is a flame retardant additive found in high impact polystyrene (HIPS)."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-37f447b9d6a8b38f80be0854c9c294af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63813cc5cb4812528045bd8f1ced4313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56425bd62513be46b9165bfd84f0dd0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-014a80fd61677e73708fa28913d7fc56</data>
    </node>
