      <data key="d1">"Gas chromatography is a method used to analyze the fatty acid composition of BIT-26T using an Agilent 6890 N apparatus."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gas chromatography is a method used to separate and analyze fatty-acid methyl esters, employing a flame ionization detector."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gas chromatography is a technique used for analyzing fatty acid methyl esters with a flame ionization detector."</data>
