    <node id="&quot;AGGLOMERATIVE HIERARCHICAL CLUSTERING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A statistical method used to analyze similarities and differences among dietary groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agglomerative Hierarchical Clustering is a method used to group similar data points, indicating developmental similarities among Tenebrio molitor larvae fed different diets."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-02f21478b87845df31740b3dab37d197&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ead6f17ad517015b638608c5bfe6852</data>
