    <node id="&quot;DEVELOPMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Development encompasses the progression of mealworms through different life stages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Development refers to the growth and maturation processes in the velvetbean caterpillar influenced by gut bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Development refers to the progression of Tenebrio molitor larvae through larval, pupal, and adult stages."&lt;SEP&gt;"The growth and maturation of insects, potentially impacted by plastic ingestion."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6ce341034979daadf1f9dc7037397d1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02f21478b87845df31740b3dab37d197&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32f340b7166025be3c56178a94ae480d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aad5e97885ea1116956513db244b8fb6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FATTY ACID (FA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LIPID"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lipids important for energy storage and cell structure, exhibiting an opposite trend to protein content across diets."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1ead6f17ad517015b638608c5bfe6852</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LINOLEIC ACID&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FATTY ACID"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An essential fatty acid with higher content in OAT-fed larvae compared to other groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Linoleic acid is an omega-6 fatty acid essential for cell membrane structure and function."&lt;SEP&gt;"Linoleic Acid is a polyunsaturated fatty acid with a reported content of 19% in some studies, ranking third after palmitic acid."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a660790845c6a68ed38b428a7756fc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a4712059883b356b4aea23cb7ef1514&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ead6f17ad517015b638608c5bfe6852</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PALMITIC ACID&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FATTY ACID"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A saturated fatty acid with lower content in OAT-fed larvae compared to other groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Palmitic acid is a common saturated fatty acid detected in mealworm lipid content."&lt;SEP&gt;"Palmitic acid is a common saturated fatty acid found in soaps and detergents."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ee46611b24ea3848df979ded841f06b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa64e5cd2c08637934509262e56ab363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ead6f17ad517015b638608c5bfe6852</data>
    </node>
