      <data key="d1">"The study of how insects grow and develop over time under different dietary conditions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1ead6f17ad517015b638608c5bfe6852</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIOMETRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Measurements related to physical characteristics and growth of insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"The measurement of biological characteristics, such as larval mass and development stages."</data>
