    <node id="&quot;KLUYVERA SP.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kluyvera sp. is a type of bacteria associated with the degradation of high molecular weight polypropylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kluyvera sp. is strongly correlated with high MW PP degradation in T. molitor larvae."</data>
