      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Graphene oxide is a material noted for its unique properties and potential interactions with biological systems."&lt;SEP&gt;"Graphene oxide is a material that Tenebrio molitor larvae can biodegrade via interactions with their gut microbiome and enzymes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Graphene oxide is a material that can be biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae through interactions with their gut microbiome and enzymes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Graphene oxide undergoes biodegradation by insect larvae such as Tenebrio molitor, with involvement of gut microbiome and enzymes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Graphene oxide is a material studied for its biodegradation by insects such as Tenebrio molitor larvae through gut microbiome and enzymatic processes."</data>
