      <data key="d1">"Mc represents the critical molecular weight of a polymer, indicating the point at which significant changes in properties occur."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mc represents the critical molecular weight, indicating the threshold above which polymer chains are not significantly degraded."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dbc20d6948e6ca1157ecd7f80a183952&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26a193cc62c03cb6460b0434df42d8c8</data>
