      <data key="d1">"Lachnatalea sp. is a genus associated with the degradation of natural organic polymers and identified in T. molitor larvae fed with PP."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lachnatalea sp. is a genus that exhibits high abundance in PET-fed groups and is potentially involved in PET degradation."</data>
