      <data key="d1">"A diet consisting of polyurethane foam, leading to lower enzyme activity in mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A diet consisting primarily of polyurethane, which is low in nutrient availability and used to study the adaptability of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"PU diet refers to the polyurethane-based diet fed to mealworms during experiments to study its degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0e81871d41a32fbdcbbd4f699efae3d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2c62bcfb28547d6b2336f142d27a326&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6746a90a5be233f46211ddf406c02e4</data>
