      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Yellow mealworm larvae are nutrient-rich insects capable of degrading plastics such as polyethylene, polystyrene, and polyvinyl chloride. They play a role in transforming organic waste into proteins, fats, and other nutrients."</data>
