      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Additives in plastics that may be degraded by insect larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plasticizers are additives used in plastics that can affect human health by impairing immune function and causing endocrine disorders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plasticizers are substances added to plastics to increase flexibility and durability, but were not detected in this experiment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0cba3b06dd82e87d3b582bc21c475868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2359b10600f30376fe077f5e942cc999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a52fc2936b4d2a771dbc2d6a37eeb710</data>
