      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"TSA medium (tryptic soy agar) is used for cultivating bacteria extracted from the guts of larvae to monitor microbial levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"TSA medium is a culture medium used for growing microorganisms, particularly in the context of antibiotic treatment effects."</data>
