      <data key="d1">"A graphical representation of data where values are represented as colors, often used to show abundance levels of compounds across different groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Heatmap is a visualization tool used to represent the abundance levels of different compounds in various groups, helping identify significantly differing compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Heatmap is a visualization tool used to corroborate findings about changes in larval gut bacterial communities shaped by different plastic diets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Heatmap visually represents data to show patterns and clustering in gut microbial communities."</data>
