      <data key="d1">"Tenebrio molitor belongs to the Tenebrionidae family, which includes beetles capable of degrading plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tenebrionidae Family includes over 20,000 species of beetles, among which Tenebrio molitor is notable for its plastic-eating capability."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Tenebrionidae family is a taxonomic group of beetles, including species like mealworms that have been studied for their ability to consume plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Tenebrionidae family is a classification of beetles to which Tenebrio molitor belongs."</data>
