      <data key="d1">"The \(\delta^{13} \mathrm{C}\) signature measures the ratio of carbon isotopes in residual plastics, indicating biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The increase in \(\delta^{13} \mathrm{C}\) of residual PET polymer serves as an effective indicator of biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is a method used to characterize the residual PET polymers in frass through carbon isotope analysis."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d0881f766e34a5d97ee711cd2edd793f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c426315f0f412528b9c6fb2a82dff2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411368ddb6a73777c1dd4c683bd389c0</data>
