      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"T-AOC measures total antioxidant capacity in larvae exposed to PE MPs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Total antioxidant capacity (T-AOC) reflects the organism's overall level of protection against oxidative stress damage caused by reactive oxygen species (ROS)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Total antioxidant capacity measures the ability of organisms to counteract oxidative stress."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a24fcfbc571e8620a1fc59b215b42e56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90367ecb21e0f14b2e548acf307a2628&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830</data>
