    <node id="&quot;DBRDA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICAL METHOD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"dbRDA (distance-based redundancy analysis) evaluates relationships between microbial communities and environmental factors."&lt;SEP&gt;"dbRDA is a multivariate analysis technique used to explain compositional variability in larval gut microbiomes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e1faf524e6fabeb512a07b13f37e51e</data>
