      <data key="d1">"PLS-SEM (partial least squares structural equation modeling) analyzes relationships between Tenebrio species, microbiome, and PE-MP properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"PLS-SEM is a statistical method used to analyze relationships between host-specificity and PCPs of PE-MPs on gut microbiomes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e1faf524e6fabeb512a07b13f37e51e</data>
