    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RCBRAY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"RCBray is a measure indicating dispersal limitation in ecological processes, estimated at 6% in this context."&lt;SEP&gt;"RCBray is a metric used to partition pairwise comparisons in microbial community analysis, assessing dispersal limitation."</data>
