      <data key="d1">"Functional Annotation of Prokaryotic Taxa (FAPROTAX), a tool used to identify differences in microbial ecology, metabolic pathways, and functions in Tenebrio larvae fed different diets."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5b30daa90b5c91314e1d65e87f191166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"KOs (KEGG Orthology groups) are assigned genes based on their encoded functions, used in this study for co-expression module analysis."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5b30daa90b5c91314e1d65e87f191166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AEROBIC CHEMOHETEROTROPHY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
