    <node id="&quot;STRAIN YT2&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BACTERIUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An isolated bacterial strain involved in PS biodegradation assays."&lt;SEP&gt;"Strain YT2 is a bacterial strain capable of degrading PS (polystyrene) by oxidizing its structure, leading to weight loss and molecular weight reduction of the PS samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"Strain YT2 is a specific bacterial strain capable of degrading polystyrene (PS) film and forming biofilms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-68041096d198a27b4ed526281746b7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06ba9ca61fb4f42582bbf7bd00ff0005&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e38968f22c4cd9bef3f1562e4ca47e1</data>
