      <data key="d0">"INSECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anticarsia gemmatalis is the scientific name for the velvetbean caterpillar, whose digestion and development depend on gut bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anticarsia gemmatalis, also called velvetbean caterpillar, relies on gut bacteria for digestion and development."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-aad5e97885ea1116956513db244b8fb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02a8ea5e75c58dcb9cfbbcd64f37d82</data>
