      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A critical factor in insect phenology, development, and behavior, affected by plastic contamination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nutrient availability influences metabolic processes and directs available nutrients for various physiological requirements in insects."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6ce341034979daadf1f9dc7037397d1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c8dab62f56f2bfabf08bfe99049386a</data>
