      <data key="d1">"Mandic et al. (2019) outlined a method for detecting laccase enzyme activity using guaiacol as a substrate."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-262d7fa1c8f2581943a41cf4897fa253</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEHAUT ET AL. (2016)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dehaut et al. (2016) introduced a microbial digestion method using 10% KOH to isolate nanoplastics from biological matrices."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-262d7fa1c8f2581943a41cf4897fa253</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MANAKA ET AL. (2023)&quot;">
