      <data key="d1">"Manaka et al. (2023) described an extraction method for isolating nanoplastics using chloroform and isopropanol separation techniques."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-262d7fa1c8f2581943a41cf4897fa253</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PARTICLE COUNT ANALYSIS (PCA)&quot;">
