      <data key="d2">chunk-e557113f1cfd2472fa9c51d1cdc3069a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PARTICLE COUNT ANALYSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Particle count analysis is a method used to quantify the number of particles generated during EPS degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e557113f1cfd2472fa9c51d1cdc3069a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLYSTYRENE DETERIORATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Polystyrene deterioration refers to the breakdown of polystyrene into smaller components by microbial action."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e557113f1cfd2472fa9c51d1cdc3069a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LB MEDIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MEDIUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"LB Media is a nutrient-rich medium used for culturing bacteria under laboratory conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB media is a nutrient-rich medium used for cultivating bacterial strains and observing colony morphology."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e557113f1cfd2472fa9c51d1cdc3069a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55bdcf1b4859e82ab15050837ab539dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;M2&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BACTERIUM"</data>
