      <data key="d0">"BACTERIUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Enterobacter hormaechei is a bacterial species with subspecies identified through genomic analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enterobacter hormaechei is a bacterium involved in the microbiome study associated with Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enterobacter hormaechei is an opportunistic pathogen known for producing endotoxins."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enterobacter hormaechei is the species to which strain LG3 belongs, known for its ability to degrade polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enterobacter hormaechei performs heterotrophic denitrification in wastewater treatment plants."</data>
