      <data key="d0">"BACTERIUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A bacterial strain previously reported to degrade PS films, reducing molecular weight by 13-25%."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acinetobacter sp. AnTc-1 is a bacterium isolated from Tribolium castaneum for microbiome studies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acinetobacter sp. AnTc-1 is a bacterial strain isolated from T. castaneum larvae for its ability to degrade polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acinetobacter sp. AnTc-1, isolated from the intestine of Tribolium castaneum, exhibits the ability to degrade polystyrene."</data>
