      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"16S ribosomal RNA gene sequencing is a molecular method used to identify bacterial species in the gut microbiome."&lt;SEP&gt;"16S ribosomal RNA gene sequencing is a technique used to identify bacterial species, confirming the presence of Pseudomonas and Achromobacter in T. molitor larval guts."</data>
