      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anaerobic oxidation is a biological process where organic matter is broken down in the absence of oxygen, as seen in polystyrene microplastics degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a3934e2c5488a209e54e10ba4c0335a6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXTRACELLULAR LIPASE&quot;">
