    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ALKALINE CELLULASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Alkaline cellulase is an enzyme produced by Bacillus sp. HSH-810, effective in breaking down cellulose under alkaline conditions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a3934e2c5488a209e54e10ba4c0335a6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THERMOOXIDATIVE PRETREATMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Thermooxidative pretreatment modifies the structure of low-density polyethylene and polyvinyl chloride microplastics to enhance their biodegradability."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a3934e2c5488a209e54e10ba4c0335a6</data>
