      <data key="d1">"Exotic Nutrition is a supplier of natural wheat bran used in mealworm diets during experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Exotic Nutrition is a supplier of natural wheat bran used in the experimental diets of mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-38e212e8bab88c4d7b6d63a157e27c00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89ff8edff56325c22cfed3871f4fbf48</data>
