      <data key="d2">chunk-38e212e8bab88c4d7b6d63a157e27c00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ada834fc8d4bea41c0ce1770d6f57e4b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TETRAHYDROFURAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"THF is an organic compound used as a solvent in various chemical reactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran (THF) is a solvent used for extracting polymers like PS in analytical procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran is a solvent used for extracting PS samples during HT-GPC analysis."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0cba3b06dd82e87d3b582bc21c475868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ada834fc8d4bea41c0ce1770d6f57e4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa3bd7c611ad935dba56fd3d7300cbc3</data>
