    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ALKENE BONDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FUNCTIONAL GROUP"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Alkene bonds (C=C-H) are identified in the NMR spectra of residual polymers from PE-fed mealworms, indicating chemical modifications."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-05b7bf66b11c66f02e73a07fb823b8fa</data>
