      <data key="d2">chunk-706b5d3a2fa68c3f52b58132d05b7165</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GYRB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">GENE</data>
      <data key="d1">gyrB is one of the housekeeping genes used for phylogenetic analysis of the bacterial strain BIT-26\(^{\mathrm{T}}\)."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-706b5d3a2fa68c3f52b58132d05b7165</data>
    </node>
