      <data key="d1">"\(T\). molitor larvae are capable of digesting LDPE, converting it into \(\mathrm{CO}_2\) and assimilating a small fraction as biomass."&lt;SEP&gt;"\(T\). molitor, likely Tenebrio molitor (larvae), plays a role in consuming and degrading PE during the biodegradation process."</data>
