      <data key="d1">"Pro-oxidant additives are chemical agents that accelerate the oxidation process, enhancing the biodegradation of polyethylene films."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pro-oxidant additives are substances used to accelerate the degradation of plastics through oxidation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pro-oxidant additives enhance the biodegradation of polyethylene films."</data>
