      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"THF extractable ratio (TER) measures the proportion of polystyrene extracted from frass using tetrahydrofuran."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8bb63b06976c3a8e6f2cea85c1ecf518</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLIC MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"TER refers to THF extractable ratio, which indicates the fraction of residual PS polymer in egested frass, indirectly reflecting PS degradability."&lt;SEP&gt;"The THF Extractable Ratio (TER) measures the extent of PS biodegradation or digestion in larval guts."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-85c9587b55f24a8ae5ba6b478dbb98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d5a9fbe4803ded646c6a5e4d23ca93a</data>
