      <data key="d1">"Palmitic Acid is a saturated fatty acid ranked third in some studies, with a content range of 16.7 to 19.4%, but determined to be lower (12.1–17.7%) in this work depending on feed type."&lt;SEP&gt;"Palmitic acid is a fatty acid measured in larvae, playing a role in the fatty acid profile."</data>
