      <data key="d0">"FATTY ACID"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Stearic Acid is a saturated fatty acid present in percentage units, usually below 1% except in certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stearic acid (C18:0) is a saturated long-chain fatty acid that occurs naturally in animal and plant fats."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stearic acid is a fatty acid measured in larvae, forming part of the fatty acid profile."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a660790845c6a68ed38b428a7756fc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a170da66288c73388872b8a43fa51e33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8a706f2bd66291a3ef925114ffd9300</data>
    </node>
