      <data key="d1">"C18:1Z, also known as Oleic acid, is a monounsaturated omega-9 fatty acid abundant in animal and plant oils."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b8a706f2bd66291a3ef925114ffd9300</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;C20:1&quot;">
