      <data key="d1">"Metagenomic analysis provides insights into the composition and function of the human distal gut microbiome."&lt;SEP&gt;"The human distal gut microbiome refers to the microbial community residing in the lower gastrointestinal tract, playing a role in digestion and metabolism."</data>
