    <node id="&quot;NANOPORE SEQUENCING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A sequencing technology used to analyze genetic material, highlighting gene expression changes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nanopore sequencing is a technology used to identify degradative enzymes in Enterobacter hormaechei LG3."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nanopore sequencing is an advanced technology for DNA sequencing with applications in genomics and microbiology."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dc31a0931fceb1446bc6ec4d0c587f7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7cbc8be34e0de8aebc6fd547bacc627&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcc545cfe4d6e8e04c3698a149d4101a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIOFILM-ASSOCIATED PROTEINS&quot;">
