      <data key="d1">"Biofilm-associated proteins are upregulated in Enterobacter hormaechei LG3 during polystyrene degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a7cbc8be34e0de8aebc6fd547bacc627</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SURFACE OXIDATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Surface oxidation refers to changes in the surface chemistry of polystyrene during biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Surface oxidation refers to the process where polymers undergo chemical changes due to aging, affecting their properties."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-582f48080aab075de76c9c590558639f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7cbc8be34e0de8aebc6fd547bacc627</data>
