      <data key="d1">"Mi-PS are small beads of polystyrene used as a carbon source for bacterial degradation studies."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eafea2357c59ac6712f4d9ab41ac5d14</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AEROBIC CONDITIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aerobic conditions refer to environments where oxygen is present, facilitating certain bacterial activities such as plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aerobic conditions refer to environments with the presence of oxygen, influencing microbial growth and degradation activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conditions where oxygen is present, contrasting with anaerobic environments."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eafea2357c59ac6712f4d9ab41ac5d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcc545cfe4d6e8e04c3698a149d4101a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d80979bb7e58b10bb558705b5d96fa99</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENDOTOXINS&quot;">
