      <data key="d1">"Palladium catalysts are used in heated fan boxes inside the anaerobic chamber to remove oxygen traces."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fdb13eda4d3cf5385a0a8284c7e213b0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HYDROGEN SULFIDE REMOVAL COLUMN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A hydrogen sulfide removal column continuously recirculates the chamber's atmosphere to remove H₂S."&lt;SEP&gt;"A system designed to remove H₂S by continuously recirculating the chamber's atmosphere through it."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fdb13eda4d3cf5385a0a8284c7e213b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-050a4c71685bf71165985a79f528ed58</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EG1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STRAIN"</data>
