      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Polystyrene degradability refers to the ability of selected bacterial cells to break down polystyrene, as evaluated through phylogenetic analysis using their 16S rRNA sequences."</data>
