    </node>
    <node id="&quot;E. COLI MA4&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BACTERIUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"E. coli MA4 is a bacterial strain that does not grow well on polystyrene micro-sprayed plates."&lt;SEP&gt;"E. coli MA4 is a bacterial strain with reduced adhesion to polystyrene film."</data>
