    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PE POLYMER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PE polymer is a crystalline plastic with side chains, less prone to depolymerization in the gut microenvironment of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The PE polymer experiences limited-extent depolymerization during insect ingestion, with observed increases in molecular weight values."</data>
