      <data key="d2">chunk-beb3c133fa4d5851f0feff55507c6874</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"MP refers to microplastics, larger plastic particles resulting from the breakdown of ingested plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Number-average molecular weight (Mp) measures the average molecular weight of polymers, showing significant changes during biodegradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d0881f766e34a5d97ee711cd2edd793f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beb3c133fa4d5851f0feff55507c6874</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Size-average molecular weight (Ms) provides insights into the size distribution of polymer chains after biodegradation."</data>
