    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MATLAB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"MATLAB is a computational tool used for modeling and simulating the size-frequency distribution of residual plastic particles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Software used for optimizing kinetic parameters and simulating half-life times of ingested plastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d0881f766e34a5d97ee711cd2edd793f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beb3c133fa4d5851f0feff55507c6874</data>
