    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MATURITY MAINTENANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Maturity maintenance involves the energy needed to sustain the mature state of an organism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maturity maintenance is a constant biological process in larvae, unaffected by larval growth stages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maturity maintenance refers to the constant physiological process in larvae that does not change during growth."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e819d53f76bcab4b74eba714efd32163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dcd4cd232a018bcab118acc67b3f0f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eee7e44e4c15567a057d7d295d240211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESERVE COMPOSITION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLITE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Reserve composition refers to the biochemical makeup of the energy reserves accumulated in an organism."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eee7e44e4c15567a057d7d295d240211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAINTENANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Maintenance involves the use of energy reserves for sustaining basic physiological functions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eee7e44e4c15567a057d7d295d240211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STANDARD DEB MODEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The standard DEB model provides a foundational framework for describing energy fluxes in organisms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eee7e44e4c15567a057d7d295d240211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIMPLIFIED DEB MODEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The simplified DEB model offers a reduced version of the standard DEB model, focusing on toxicological impacts."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eee7e44e4c15567a057d7d295d240211</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXTENDED SIMPLIFIED DEB MODEL&quot;">
